            "headingHinglish": "Safed rumaal par haldi ka jaadu",
            "body": "Sunday dopahar ka khana chal raha tha. Shaunak apni chachi Ms. Chitnis ke paas baith kar garam-garam dal-chawal kha raha tha. Baaton-baaton mein chammach hila aur peeli dal ki ek boond Shaunak ke safed suti rumaal (cotton handkerchief) par gir gayi. Rumaal par **chamakdar peela daag** lag gaya.\n\nShaunak turant washbasin ki taraf bhaaga aur daag par **nahane ka sabun** ragad diya. Jaise hi sabun ka jhaag haldi ke daag se chhua, Shaunak ki aankhein phati reh gayin: peela daag achanak **gehra laal-bhoora (reddish-brown)** ho gaya!\n\n\"Chachi, dekhiye! Sabun lagate hi peeli haldi laal kaise ho gayi? Rumaal to aur kharab ho gaya!\" Shaunak ne ghabra kar kaha.\n\nMs. Chitnis, jo ek dawa-company ki quality lab mein kaam karti thin, hanste hue washbasin ke paas aayin. Unhone pahle rumaal ko khub saare paani se dhulwaya, aur phir rasoi se **nimbu ka ek chhota tukda** laakar us laal-bhoore daag par do boond ras nichod diya. Palak jhapakte hi laal-bhoora rang gayab ho gaya aur daag wapas **peela** ho gaya!\n\nShaunak hairaan tha: \"Sabun se laal-bhoora, aur nimbu se wapas peela? Chachi, haldi ke andar koi switch laga hai kya?\"\n\nMs. Chitnis muskurayin, \"Switch hi samajh lo, beta! Chemistry mein aisi cheezon ko **indicator** kehte hain. Sabun mein **base** hai aur nimbu mein **acid**, aur haldi apna rang badal kar chugli kar deti hai ki uske saamne kaun aaya hai.\" Chalo, Shaunak ke rumaal se shuru karke is poore khel ko samajhte hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Sunday dopahar ka khana chal raha tha. Shaunak apni chachi Ms. Chitnis ke paas baith kar garam-garam dal-chawal kha raha tha. Baaton-baaton mein chammach hila aur peeli dal ki ek boond Shaunak ke safed suti rumaal (cotton handkerchief) par gir gayi. Rumaal par **chamakdar peela daag** lag gaya.\n\nShaunak turant washbasin ki taraf bhaaga aur daag par **nahane ka sabun** ragad diya. Jaise hi sabun ka jhaag haldi ke daag se chhua, Shaunak ki aankhein phati reh gayin: peela daag achanak **gehra laal-bhoora (reddish-brown)** ho gaya!\n\n\"Chachi, dekhiye! Sabun lagate hi peeli haldi laal kaise ho gayi? Rumaal to aur kharab ho gaya!\" Shaunak ne ghabra kar kaha.\n\nMs. Chitnis, jo ek dawa-company ki quality lab mein kaam karti thin, hanste hue washbasin ke paas aayin. Unhone pahle rumaal ko khub saare paani se dhulwaya, aur phir rasoi se **nimbu ka ek chhota tukda** laakar us laal-bhoore daag par do boond ras nichod diya. Palak jhapakte hi laal-bhoora rang gayab ho gaya aur daag wapas **peela** ho gaya!\n\nShaunak hairaan tha: \"Sabun se laal-bhoora, aur nimbu se wapas peela? Chachi, haldi ke andar koi switch laga hai kya?\"\n\nMs. Chitnis muskurayin, \"Switch hi samajh lo, beta! Chemistry mein aisi cheezon ko **indicator** kehte hain. Sabun mein **base** hai aur nimbu mein **acid**, aur haldi apna rang badal kar chugli kar deti hai ki uske saamne kaun aaya hai.\" Chalo, Shaunak ke rumaal se shuru karke is poore khel ko samajhte hain."
