            "body": "- **Common Salt (NaCl):** Samudra ke paani ke evaporation aur zameen ke neeche **Rock Salt** ki khudai se milta hai. Ye NaOH, CaOCl₂, NaHCO₃, aur Na₂CO₃·10H₂O banane ka mukhya raw material hai.\n- **Chlor-Alkali Process:** Brine (NaCl(aq)) ke electrolysis se teen cheezein milti hain:\n  2NaCl(aq) + 2H₂O(l) --(Electricity)--> 2NaOH(aq) (near cathode) + Cl₂(g) (at anode) + H₂(g) (at cathode)\n- **Bleaching Powder (CaOCl₂ — Calcium oxychloride):**\n  Ca(OH)₂ (dry slaked lime) + Cl₂ → CaOCl₂ + H₂O. Kapdon/kaagaz ki bleaching, oxidising agent, aur peene ke paani ko disinfect karne ke kaam aata hai.\n- **Baking Soda (NaHCO₃ — Sodium hydrogencarbonate):**\n  - Preparation: NaCl + H₂O + CO₂ + NH₃ → NH₄Cl + NaHCO₃\n  - Heating: 2NaHCO₃ --(Heat)--> Na₂CO₃ + H₂O + CO₂↑\n  - **Baking Powder** = NaHCO₃ + Mild edible acid (Tartaric acid) taaki CO₂ se cake spongy bane aur Na₂CO₃ ka kadwapan neutralise ho jaaye.\n  - Antacid aur **Soda-Acid Fire Extinguisher** mein bhi mukhya bhoomika nibhata hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Common Salt (NaCl):** Samudra ke paani ke evaporation aur zameen ke neeche **Rock Salt** ki khudai se milta hai. Ye NaOH, CaOCl₂, NaHCO₃, aur Na₂CO₃·10H₂O banane ka mukhya raw material hai.\n- **Chlor-Alkali Process:** Brine (NaCl(aq)) ke electrolysis se teen cheezein milti hain:\n  2NaCl(aq) + 2H₂O(l) --(Electricity)--> 2NaOH(aq) (near cathode) + Cl₂(g) (at anode) + H₂(g) (at cathode)\n- **Bleaching Powder (CaOCl₂ — Calcium oxychloride):**\n  Ca(OH)₂ (dry slaked lime) + Cl₂ → CaOCl₂ + H₂O. Kapdon/kaagaz ki bleaching, oxidising agent, aur peene ke paani ko disinfect karne ke kaam aata hai.\n- **Baking Soda (NaHCO₃ — Sodium hydrogencarbonate):**\n  - Preparation: NaCl + H₂O + CO₂ + NH₃ → NH₄Cl + NaHCO₃\n  - Heating: 2NaHCO₃ --(Heat)--> Na₂CO₃ + H₂O + CO₂↑\n  - **Baking Powder** = NaHCO₃ + Mild edible acid (Tartaric acid) taaki CO₂ se cake spongy bane aur Na₂CO₃ ka kadwapan neutralise ho jaaye.\n  - Antacid aur **Soda-Acid Fire Extinguisher** mein bhi mukhya bhoomika nibhata hai."
