            "body": "Shaabash! Aaj tumne dekha ki ek phoonk se udta chaandi ka warq, tezi se jalta bulb ka filament aur dhaage par latki ghanti, sab dhatuon ke ek hi kunji gun ke alag-alag rang hain. Advika ne mithai ke dabbe ke upar ek warq ka tukda dekha aur muskuraai, \"Chachaji, ab main samajh gayi: ye chaandi ki sheet itni patli kyun ban sakti hai.\" Mr. Ambekar ne kaha, \"Aur ghar chal kar apna tester bhi banayenge.\"\n\n---\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab tak humne dhatuon ko **sirf dekha, chhua aur bajaaya**. Par jab dhatu hawa ke oxygen se milti hai to kya hota hai? Kuch dhatuein tezi se jal uthti hain, kuch kaali ho jaati hain, aur kuch chamakti hi rehti hain. Agle topic **\"Dhatuon Ka Oxygen Se Rishta\"** mein hum dekhenge ki purana tamba (copper) ka bartan kaala kyun padta hai aur aluminium ki foil chamakdar kyun rehti hai.",
