            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Topic 2 mein humne dekha ki hawa ki oxygen se dhatuon ka rishta alag-alag hota hai: sodium turant, magnesium jalne par, iron dheere-dheere, aur gold bilkul nahi. Ab hum oxygen ki jagah do aur \"takkar wale\" saathi lete hain: **paani** (thanda, garm aur bhaap) aur **acid**. Class 9 mein tumne dekha tha ki sodium paani par daudta hai aur Chapter 1 mein ki dhatu dilute acid se hydrogen deti hai. Aaj hum un sabko ek **seedhi par** rakhenge, ek ladder, aur do naye kirdaar milenge: **nitric acid**, jo hydrogen deta hi nahi, aur **aqua regia**, jo wo gold bhi ghula deta hai jise koi akela acid nahi chhoota.",
