            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Ladder of vigour** | Dhatuon ko is hisaab se sajana ki paani ke saath kaun kitni tezi se react karti hai | K sabse upar, Au sabse neeche |\n| **Steam (bhaap)** | Paani ki garm gas | Boiler ki bhaap |\n| **Hydroxide** | Dhatu aur OH⁻ ka compound, aksar base | NaOH, Ca(OH)₂ |\n| **Oxidising acid** | Aisa acid jo khud doosre padarth ko oxidise kar de, hydrogen ke bajaay | Nitric acid, HNO₃ |\n| **Nitrogen dioxide** | Bhoori, zehreeli gas NO₂ | Taambe par concentrated nitric acid se |\n| **Aqua regia** | Concentrated HNO₃ (1 hissa) aur concentrated HCl (3 hisse) ka mix; \"shahi paani\" | Gold ghulane wala mix |\n| **Noble metals** | Wo dhatu jo kisi akele acid se nahi ghulte | Gold, platinum |\n| **Tezaab** | Tez acid ka bol-chaal ka naam; sonar aksar aqua regia ko bhi yahi kehte hain | Sonar ki workshop |",
