            "headingHinglish": "Railway yard mein chingariyon ka phool",
            "body": "Mr. Hardikar apne bhatije Harshal ko ek Sunday railway yard ke bahar wali pagdandi par le gaye. Door ek khaali patri par kuch mazdoor safed helmet aur kaale chashme pehne khade the. Unke beech do patriyon ke sire kuch milimetre ke gap ke saath rakhe the, aur gap ke upar ek mitti-jaisa saancha (mould) bandha tha. Ek mazdoor ne ek chhoti si cheez jalayi, aur achanak saancha **chingariyon ke phool** ki tarah phat pada: laal-peeli roshni, dhuaan, aur kuch hi der mein saancha ke neeche se pighla hua, tapta laal loha behta dikha. Harshal ne awaaz mein \"waah!\" kaha. Mr. Hardikar ne uska kandha pakda: \"Peeche hi rehna. Ye bahut hi zyada garm hota hai, aur is kaam ko sirf trained log, poore safety ke saath karte hain.\"\n\nKuch minute baad ghati jam gayi, saancha hataya gaya, aur dono patriyan **ek hi lambi patri** ban chuki thi. \"Chacha, sab kuch itni jaldi? Loha pighlane ke liye to bahut badi bhatti chahiye.\" Mr. Hardikar ne ek paper par seedhi bani: \"Yahan koi bhatti nahi thi. Mazdoor ne **aluminium ka powder** aur **loha ka oxide** milakar jalaya. Aluminium ne loha ke oxide se **loha nikaal liya**, aur is jagah-badal ki ladai mein itni garmi nikli ki loha khud pighal gaya. Yahi hai displacement ka sabse bada, garm roop.\"\n\n\"Par aluminium ko loha se zyada taakatwar kyun maana?\" Mr. Hardikar muskuraye: \"Wahi sawaal hai jisse aaj ka topic shuru hota hai. Aao reactivity series ko kaam par lagate hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Hardikar apne bhatije Harshal ko ek Sunday railway yard ke bahar wali pagdandi par le gaye. Door ek khaali patri par kuch mazdoor safed helmet aur kaale chashme pehne khade the. Unke beech do patriyon ke sire kuch milimetre ke gap ke saath rakhe the, aur gap ke upar ek mitti-jaisa saancha (mould) bandha tha. Ek mazdoor ne ek chhoti si cheez jalayi, aur achanak saancha **chingariyon ke phool** ki tarah phat pada: laal-peeli roshni, dhuaan, aur kuch hi der mein saancha ke neeche se pighla hua, tapta laal loha behta dikha. Harshal ne awaaz mein \"waah!\" kaha. Mr. Hardikar ne uska kandha pakda: \"Peeche hi rehna. Ye bahut hi zyada garm hota hai, aur is kaam ko sirf trained log, poore safety ke saath karte hain.\"\n\nKuch minute baad ghati jam gayi, saancha hataya gaya, aur dono patriyan **ek hi lambi patri** ban chuki thi. \"Chacha, sab kuch itni jaldi? Loha pighlane ke liye to bahut badi bhatti chahiye.\" Mr. Hardikar ne ek paper par seedhi bani: \"Yahan koi bhatti nahi thi. Mazdoor ne **aluminium ka powder** aur **loha ka oxide** milakar jalaya. Aluminium ne loha ke oxide se **loha nikaal liya**, aur is jagah-badal ki ladai mein itni garmi nikli ki loha khud pighal gaya. Yahi hai displacement ka sabse bada, garm roop.\"\n\n\"Par aluminium ko loha se zyada taakatwar kyun maana?\" Mr. Hardikar muskuraye: \"Wahi sawaal hai jisse aaj ka topic shuru hota hai. Aao reactivity series ko kaam par lagate hain.\""
