            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Displacement** | Zyada reactive dhatu kam reactive dhatu ko uske salt ke ghol se nikaal deti hai | Zn + 2AgNO₃ → Zn(NO₃)₂ + 2Ag |\n| **Reactivity series** | Dhatuon ki list, zyada reactive se kam reactive | K, Na, Ca, Mg, Al, Zn, Fe, Pb, [H], Cu, Hg, Ag, Au |\n| **Ionic equation** | Sirf wo ions jo asal mein badalte hain, darshak ions chhodkar | Zn + Cu²⁺ → Zn²⁺ + Cu |\n| **Darshak ion (spectator)** | Wo ion jo reaction mein badalta nahi | SO₄²⁻ in Fe + CuSO₄ |\n| **Thermite** | Aluminium powder aur loha ke oxide ka mix, jo bahut garmi ke saath react karta hai | 2Al + Fe₂O₃ → Al₂O₃ + 2Fe |\n| **Slag** | Reaction ke baad banne wala halka, tairne wala oxide | Thermite mein Al₂O₃ |\n| **Strip** | Dhatu ki patli patti jo ghol mein dubayi jaati hai | Zinc ki strip |\n| **Mole ratio** | Equation ke coefficients se mila moles ka anupaat | 1 mol Fe : 1 mol Cu |",
