            "body": "Ek nazar mein poore chapter ka safar: dhatu aur adhaatu ke gun se lekar unki reaction aur pehchaan tak.\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Dhatu aur adhaatu ke bhautik gun | Chamak, malleable, ductile, bijli aur garmi ka sanchaalan, awaaz, aur mercury, sodium, graphite jaise apvaad. |\n| Topic 2 | Dhatuon ka oxygen se rishta | Dhatuein oxygen se oxide banati hain, tarnish aur patina, aluminium ki parat, amphoteric oxide. |\n| Topic 3 | Dhatuon ki paani aur acid se takkar | Paani, steam aur dilute acid se H₂ ki seedhi, nitric acid aur aqua regia ka alag vyavhaar. |\n| Topic 4 | Reactivity series ka istemal | Displacement ki bhavishyavani, thermite, data se series banana, aur reactivity ka kaaran electron khona. |\n| Topic 5 | Adhaatuon ke rasayanik gun aur upyog | Oxygen, hydrogen aur dhatuon ke saath reaction, halogen displacement, matches aur allotropes. |\n| Topic 6 | Dhatu ya adhaatu? | Pehchaan ke tests, ionic yaugik ka recall, mixed problems aur chapter ka saar. |\n\n---\n\nMihika ne notebook band kari aur chacha ki tray ko dekh kar muskuraayi. \"Chachu, ab main kisi bhi cheez ko dekhte hi puchhungi: chamak? bijli? awaaz? chumbak? Pehle test, phir faisla!\" Mr. Modak ne kaha, \"Bilkul, aur jab test kam padein to kai tests milao, jaise chacha karte hain.\" Chacha ne hathode se ek aluminium ka dhakkan thoka, aur wo 'tang' bol utha.\n\n**Agle Chapter Mein Kya Hai?** Chapter 3 **\"Metallurgy\"**: ye saari dhatuein zameen ke andar kahan milti hain, aur hum unhein dharti se bahar kaise nikaalte hain?",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ek nazar mein poore chapter ka safar: dhatu aur adhaatu ke gun se lekar unki reaction aur pehchaan tak.\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Dhatu aur adhaatu ke bhautik gun | Chamak, malleable, ductile, bijli aur garmi ka sanchaalan, awaaz, aur mercury, sodium, graphite jaise apvaad. |\n| Topic 2 | Dhatuon ka oxygen se rishta | Dhatuein oxygen se oxide banati hain, tarnish aur patina, aluminium ki parat, amphoteric oxide. |\n| Topic 3 | Dhatuon ki paani aur acid se takkar | Paani, steam aur dilute acid se H₂ ki seedhi, nitric acid aur aqua regia ka alag vyavhaar. |\n| Topic 4 | Reactivity series ka istemal | Displacement ki bhavishyavani, thermite, data se series banana, aur reactivity ka kaaran electron khona. |\n| Topic 5 | Adhaatuon ke rasayanik gun aur upyog | Oxygen, hydrogen aur dhatuon ke saath reaction, halogen displacement, matches aur allotropes. |\n| Topic 6 | Dhatu ya adhaatu? | Pehchaan ke tests, ionic yaugik ka recall, mixed problems aur chapter ka saar. |\n\n---\n\nMihika ne notebook band kari aur chacha ki tray ko dekh kar muskuraayi. \"Chachu, ab main kisi bhi cheez ko dekhte hi puchhungi: chamak? bijli? awaaz? chumbak? Pehle test, phir faisla!\" Mr. Modak ne kaha, \"Bilkul, aur jab test kam padein to kai tests milao, jaise chacha karte hain.\" Chacha ne hathode se ek aluminium ka dhakkan thoka, aur wo 'tang' bol utha.\n\n**Agle Chapter Mein Kya Hai?** Chapter 3 **\"Metallurgy\"**: ye saari dhatuein zameen ke andar kahan milti hain, aur hum unhein dharti se bahar kaise nikaalte hain?"
