            "explanation": "Pitfall to avoid (\"Mineral aur ore ek hi cheez hai.\"): Galat. Ek chhoti kahani: Devansh ne gallery mein quartz ka tukda dekha aur socha ki wo bhi ek \"ore\" hai. Mr. Pethe ne poochha: \"Isme kaun si dhatu hai?\" Quartz mein sirf silicon aur oxygen hain (SiO₂), koi kaam ki dhatu nahi. To quartz mineral hai, ore nahi. Aur clay mein aluminium hai par nikaalna mehenga, to wo bhi mineral hai, ore nahi. Har ore mineral hai, har mineral ore nahi.",
            "explanationHinglish": "Bachke rehna (\"Mineral aur ore ek hi cheez hai.\"): Galat. Ek chhoti kahani: Devansh ne gallery mein quartz ka tukda dekha aur socha ki wo bhi ek \"ore\" hai. Mr. Pethe ne poochha: \"Isme kaun si dhatu hai?\" Quartz mein sirf silicon aur oxygen hain (SiO₂), koi kaam ki dhatu nahi. To quartz mineral hai, ore nahi. Aur clay mein aluminium hai par nikaalna mehenga, to wo bhi mineral hai, ore nahi. Har ore mineral hai, har mineral ore nahi."
