            "body": "School ke mele mein ek stall par bada-sa hara dibba rakha tha jis par likha tha **\"Khaali can yahan daalein\"**. Mr. Ranade apni bhatiji Tanmayi ke saath mele mein ghoom rahe the. Tanmayi ne apne haath ka khaali cola can us dibbe mein daala, aur ek pal ruk kar poochha.\n\n\"Chacha, ye can recycle hoke kahan jaata hai? Aur ye banta kaise hai? Ye to bilkul halka hai, par chamkeela aur kabhi zang bhi nahi lagta.\"\n\nMr. Ranade muskuraye. \"Tanmayi, ye aluminium ka bana hai. Aur isse zyada dilchasp dhatu kam hi hain. Zameen ki parat (crust) mein aluminium sabse zyada milne wali **dhatu** hai, lagbhag 8% (mass ke hisaab se). Phir bhi ek zamaane mein ye bahut mehngi thi.\"\n\n\"Mehngi? Itni zyada hai to mehngi kyun?\"\n\n\"Kyunki wo kabhi **akeli** nahi milti. Wo hamesha oxygen se bandhi hui **Al₂O₃** ki shakal mein hoti hai, aur Al-O ka bandhan itna majboot hai ki carbon use todh nahi paata. Pichhle topic ki table yaad karo: Al series mein oopar baithi hai. Isliye use bijli se hi nikaalna padta hai. Aur wo bijli bahut lagti hai.\"\n\n\"To phir can ko recycle karna aur bhi zaroori hua!\" Tanmayi ne hanste hue kaha.\n\n\"Bilkul. Chalo, pehle dekhte hain ki wo laal mitti se chamakte can tak kaise pahunchta hai. Wapsi ka kissa baad mein.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "School ke mele mein ek stall par bada-sa hara dibba rakha tha jis par likha tha **\"Khaali can yahan daalein\"**. Mr. Ranade apni bhatiji Tanmayi ke saath mele mein ghoom rahe the. Tanmayi ne apne haath ka khaali cola can us dibbe mein daala, aur ek pal ruk kar poochha.\n\n\"Chacha, ye can recycle hoke kahan jaata hai? Aur ye banta kaise hai? Ye to bilkul halka hai, par chamkeela aur kabhi zang bhi nahi lagta.\"\n\nMr. Ranade muskuraye. \"Tanmayi, ye aluminium ka bana hai. Aur isse zyada dilchasp dhatu kam hi hain. Zameen ki parat (crust) mein aluminium sabse zyada milne wali **dhatu** hai, lagbhag 8% (mass ke hisaab se). Phir bhi ek zamaane mein ye bahut mehngi thi.\"\n\n\"Mehngi? Itni zyada hai to mehngi kyun?\"\n\n\"Kyunki wo kabhi **akeli** nahi milti. Wo hamesha oxygen se bandhi hui **Al₂O₃** ki shakal mein hoti hai, aur Al-O ka bandhan itna majboot hai ki carbon use todh nahi paata. Pichhle topic ki table yaad karo: Al series mein oopar baithi hai. Isliye use bijli se hi nikaalna padta hai. Aur wo bijli bahut lagti hai.\"\n\n\"To phir can ko recycle karna aur bhi zaroori hua!\" Tanmayi ne hanste hue kaha.\n\n\"Bilkul. Chalo, pehle dekhte hain ki wo laal mitti se chamakte can tak kaise pahunchta hai. Wapsi ka kissa baad mein.\""
