            "heading": "Closing",
            "headingHinglish": "Closing",
            "body": "Mr. Bhave aur Pratham baraat ke peeche-peeche mandir tak gaye. Pratham ne ghanti ki goonj ko ek baar aur suna aur kaha, \"Mama, ab samajh aaya. Ye ghanti copper aur tin ke mel se bani hai, isliye sakht hai aur goonjti hai. Dulhan ka haar bhi isliye 22 carat ka hai, taaki mazboot rahe. Aur jo copper ki taar hum ghar mein dekhte hain, wo electrolysis se pure kiya hua copper hai!\"\n\nMr. Bhave muskuraye, \"Bilkul, bhanje. Dhatu ko shuddh bhi kiya jaata hai aur kabhi-kabhi jaan-boojhkar milaya bhi jaata hai. Par ek baat abhi baaki hai. Wo mandir ki purani ghanti dekho, kai dhatu ki cheezein saalon baad bhi chamakti hain, par loha jaisi kai cheezein zang khakar gal jaati hain. Is zang ko rokna kaise hai, aur ye chapter ka saar kya hai, wo agle topic mein.\"\n\n**Agle Topic Mein Kya Hai?** Topic 7 **\"Corrosion Se Bachav aur Chapter Ka Saar\"**: loha kyun zang khata hai, paint, galvanising aur anodising kaise bachaate hain, Delhi ke lohe ke stambh ne lagbhag 1600 saal baad bhi zang kyun nahi pakda, aur poore chapter ka saar.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Bhave aur Pratham baraat ke peeche-peeche mandir tak gaye. Pratham ne ghanti ki goonj ko ek baar aur suna aur kaha, \"Mama, ab samajh aaya. Ye ghanti copper aur tin ke mel se bani hai, isliye sakht hai aur goonjti hai. Dulhan ka haar bhi isliye 22 carat ka hai, taaki mazboot rahe. Aur jo copper ki taar hum ghar mein dekhte hain, wo electrolysis se pure kiya hua copper hai!\"\n\nMr. Bhave muskuraye, \"Bilkul, bhanje. Dhatu ko shuddh bhi kiya jaata hai aur kabhi-kabhi jaan-boojhkar milaya bhi jaata hai. Par ek baat abhi baaki hai. Wo mandir ki purani ghanti dekho, kai dhatu ki cheezein saalon baad bhi chamakti hain, par loha jaisi kai cheezein zang khakar gal jaati hain. Is zang ko rokna kaise hai, aur ye chapter ka saar kya hai, wo agle topic mein.\"\n\n**Agle Topic Mein Kya Hai?** Topic 7 **\"Corrosion Se Bachav aur Chapter Ka Saar\"**: loha kyun zang khata hai, paint, galvanising aur anodising kaise bachaate hain, Delhi ke lohe ke stambh ne lagbhag 1600 saal baad bhi zang kyun nahi pakda, aur poore chapter ka saar."
