            "heading": "Qutub parisar ka khamba jo thakta nahi",
            "headingHinglish": "Qutub parisar ka khamba jo thakta nahi",
            "body": "Chhutti ke din **Mr. Samant** apni bhanji **Vrinda** ko Delhi ke Qutub parisar mein le gaye. Ek khule maidan mein lohe ka lamba, kaala-sa khamba khada tha, lagbhag 7 meter ooncha. Aas-paas ek chhoti si railing thi aur tourist guide kah raha tha, \"Ye khamba lagbhag 1600 saal purana hai, aur ab tak zang se gira nahi!\"\n\nEk tourist ne dusre se kaha, \"Zaroor isme koi jaadu hai, ya ye stainless steel hoga.\" Vrinda ne Mr. Samant ki aasteen kheenchi. \"Mama, mere ghar ki loha ki balti to ek monsoon mein hi zang khaane lagti hai. Is khambhe ko saal-dar-saal baarish aur dhoop mein khade rehte kya hua?\"\n\nMr. Samant muskuraye. \"Bahut accha sawaal. Pehle ye samjho ki balti ke saath kya hota hai, tab khambhe ka raaz khulega. Chalo, zang ko andar se dekhte hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Chhutti ke din **Mr. Samant** apni bhanji **Vrinda** ko Delhi ke Qutub parisar mein le gaye. Ek khule maidan mein lohe ka lamba, kaala-sa khamba khada tha, lagbhag 7 meter ooncha. Aas-paas ek chhoti si railing thi aur tourist guide kah raha tha, \"Ye khamba lagbhag 1600 saal purana hai, aur ab tak zang se gira nahi!\"\n\nEk tourist ne dusre se kaha, \"Zaroor isme koi jaadu hai, ya ye stainless steel hoga.\" Vrinda ne Mr. Samant ki aasteen kheenchi. \"Mama, mere ghar ki loha ki balti to ek monsoon mein hi zang khaane lagti hai. Is khambhe ko saal-dar-saal baarish aur dhoop mein khade rehte kya hua?\"\n\nMr. Samant muskuraye. \"Bahut accha sawaal. Pehle ye samjho ki balti ke saath kya hota hai, tab khambhe ka raaz khulega. Chalo, zang ko andar se dekhte hain.\""
