            "headingHinglish": "Part H: Decision task, 6 cheezein, 6 suraksha",
            "body": "Har cheez ke liye sabse theek tareeka chuno aur ek line mein wajah likho.\n\n| Cheez | Sabse theek tareeka | Wajah |\n|---|---|---|\n| Bagiche ka loha ka gate | Paint (aur kabhi-kabhi dubara) | Sasta barrier, dikhne mein bhi accha |\n| Samundar mein chalta jahaaz | Paint, aur hull se jude Mg ya Zn ke block | Scratch par bhi suraksha |\n| Cycle ki chain | Tel ya grease | Paint chalte-chalte chhil jaata, tel chalne wale hisse ko chikna bhi rakhta hai |\n| Rasoi ka chamach ya kadhai | Stainless steel | Alloy hai, zang nahi lagti |\n| Baarish ke paani ki tanki ya chaadar | Galvanising | Zinc khurch par bhi loha bachata hai |\n| Aluminium ki khidki ka frame | Anodising | Moti oxide parat, rang bhi aata hai |",
            "bodyHinglish": "Har cheez ke liye sabse theek tareeka chuno aur ek line mein wajah likho.\n\n| Cheez | Sabse theek tareeka | Wajah |\n|---|---|---|\n| Bagiche ka loha ka gate | Paint (aur kabhi-kabhi dubara) | Sasta barrier, dikhne mein bhi accha |\n| Samundar mein chalta jahaaz | Paint, aur hull se jude Mg ya Zn ke block | Scratch par bhi suraksha |\n| Cycle ki chain | Tel ya grease | Paint chalte-chalte chhil jaata, tel chalne wale hisse ko chikna bhi rakhta hai |\n| Rasoi ka chamach ya kadhai | Stainless steel | Alloy hai, zang nahi lagti |\n| Baarish ke paani ki tanki ya chaadar | Galvanising | Zinc khurch par bhi loha bachata hai |\n| Aluminium ki khidki ka frame | Anodising | Moti oxide parat, rang bhi aata hai |"
