            "correctIndex": 0,
            "explanation": "Pitfall to avoid (\"Electron ghol ke andar se hokar chalte hain.\"): Nahi. Ghol mein electron nahi, ion chalte hain. Electron to bas taar mein chalte hain. Soch lo ek relay race: taar mein electron daud rahe hain, ghol mein ions. Electrode wo jagah hai jahan batten badalta hai: cathode par electron taar se nikalkar cation ko diye jaate hain, anode par anion se electron taar ko diye jaate hain. Ginti karo: taar mein jitne electron cathode ki taraf gaye, utne hi cation ne cathode par liye. Agar wahi electron ghol se bhi nikal jaate, to taar mein bijli ka hisaab nahi baithta.",
            "explanationHinglish": "Bachke rehna (\"Electron ghol ke andar se hokar chalte hain.\"): Nahi. Ghol mein electron nahi, ion chalte hain. Electron to bas taar mein chalte hain. Soch lo ek relay race: taar mein electron daud rahe hain, ghol mein ions. Electrode wo jagah hai jahan batten badalta hai: cathode par electron taar se nikalkar cation ko diye jaate hain, anode par anion se electron taar ko diye jaate hain. Ginti karo: taar mein jitne electron cathode ki taraf gaye, utne hi cation ne cathode par liye. Agar wahi electron ghol se bhi nikal jaate, to taar mein bijli ka hisaab nahi baithta."
