            "body": "| Electrolyte | Electrodes | Cathode par product | Anode par product | Ghol mein badlav |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Acidified paani (dilute H₂SO₄) | Platinum (inert) | H₂ | O₂ | Paani kam hota hai, acid thoda gaadha |\n| Concentrated NaCl (brine) | Graphite (inert) | H₂ | Cl₂ | NaOH banta hai, ghol alkaline |\n| Bahut dilute NaCl | Platinum (inert) | H₂ | O₂ | Paani kam hota hai, namak thoda gaadha |\n| CuSO₄ ghol | Platinum ya graphite (inert) | Cu | O₂ | Neela rang halka, H₂SO₄ banta hai (acidic) |\n| CuSO₄ ghol | Copper (active) | Cu | Anode ghulta hai, Cu²⁺ banta hai | Rang aur concentration wahi |\n\nIs table ko pehle **dekh kar** samjho, phir **dhak kar** poochho: \"ye electrolyte, ye electrode, to cathode par kya? anode par kya?\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Electrolyte | Electrodes | Cathode par product | Anode par product | Ghol mein badlav |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Acidified paani (dilute H₂SO₄) | Platinum (inert) | H₂ | O₂ | Paani kam hota hai, acid thoda gaadha |\n| Concentrated NaCl (brine) | Graphite (inert) | H₂ | Cl₂ | NaOH banta hai, ghol alkaline |\n| Bahut dilute NaCl | Platinum (inert) | H₂ | O₂ | Paani kam hota hai, namak thoda gaadha |\n| CuSO₄ ghol | Platinum ya graphite (inert) | Cu | O₂ | Neela rang halka, H₂SO₄ banta hai (acidic) |\n| CuSO₄ ghol | Copper (active) | Cu | Anode ghulta hai, Cu²⁺ banta hai | Rang aur concentration wahi |\n\nIs table ko pehle **dekh kar** samjho, phir **dhak kar** poochho: \"ye electrolyte, ye electrode, to cathode par kya? anode par kya?\""
