            "headingHinglish": "Polish-wale ki dukaan mein dull thali",
            "body": "Itwaar ko **Mr. Dhamdhere** apne bhanje **Shivansh** ko ek purani gali ki polish-wale ki dukaan par le gaye. Unke ghar ki steel ki pooja thali ki chamak utar gayi thi: jis nickel ki chamakdar parat se wo kabhi shishe jaisi dikhti thi, wo ghis kar patli ho gayi thi aur thali dhundhli, dagi-dagi dikh rahi thi. Dukaan ke andar bade-bade plastic ke tub rakhe the, bijli ke taar latak rahe the, aur ek kaarigar chimte se thali ko ek tub mein latka raha tha. Kuch der baad usne thali nikaali: wo **chaandi jaisi chamak** rahi thi!\n\nShivansh ki aankhen phail gayi. \"Mama, ye to jaadu hai! Dhundhli thali ek tub mein dali aur nikli to nayi! Kya usne thali par chaandi ka rang pot diya?\"\n\nMr. Dhamdhere hanse. \"Rang nahi, dhatu. Ye **electroplating** hai. Wo bijli se thali par nickel ki ek bahut patli parat chadha raha hai, baal se kai guna patli. Par pehle ek baat: tub ke paas mat jaana, aur kuch chhoona mat. Ye ghol harmful hai aur kaarigar poori training ke saath kaam karta hai. Hum doosri taraf se dekhenge.\"\n\nShivansh ne ek kadam peeche liya. \"Theek hai Mama, par ek sawaal: thali tub mein latki thi aur ek chamakdar patti bhi tub ke andar thi. Dono taar se kyun jude the? Aur thali ko taar ke kis sire se jodna hai, kaise tay hota hai?\"\n\n\"Wahi sawaal asal mein poora topic hai,\" Mr. Dhamdhere ne kaha. \"Chalo, ek-ek niyam samajhte hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Itwaar ko **Mr. Dhamdhere** apne bhanje **Shivansh** ko ek purani gali ki polish-wale ki dukaan par le gaye. Unke ghar ki steel ki pooja thali ki chamak utar gayi thi: jis nickel ki chamakdar parat se wo kabhi shishe jaisi dikhti thi, wo ghis kar patli ho gayi thi aur thali dhundhli, dagi-dagi dikh rahi thi. Dukaan ke andar bade-bade plastic ke tub rakhe the, bijli ke taar latak rahe the, aur ek kaarigar chimte se thali ko ek tub mein latka raha tha. Kuch der baad usne thali nikaali: wo **chaandi jaisi chamak** rahi thi!\n\nShivansh ki aankhen phail gayi. \"Mama, ye to jaadu hai! Dhundhli thali ek tub mein dali aur nikli to nayi! Kya usne thali par chaandi ka rang pot diya?\"\n\nMr. Dhamdhere hanse. \"Rang nahi, dhatu. Ye **electroplating** hai. Wo bijli se thali par nickel ki ek bahut patli parat chadha raha hai, baal se kai guna patli. Par pehle ek baat: tub ke paas mat jaana, aur kuch chhoona mat. Ye ghol harmful hai aur kaarigar poori training ke saath kaam karta hai. Hum doosri taraf se dekhenge.\"\n\nShivansh ne ek kadam peeche liya. \"Theek hai Mama, par ek sawaal: thali tub mein latki thi aur ek chamakdar patti bhi tub ke andar thi. Dono taar se kyun jude the? Aur thali ko taar ke kis sire se jodna hai, kaise tay hota hai?\"\n\n\"Wahi sawaal asal mein poora topic hai,\" Mr. Dhamdhere ne kaha. \"Chalo, ek-ek niyam samajhte hain.\""
