            "body": "Mr. Zende apni bhanji Sanchi ko bus-stand ke paas ek chai stall par le gaye. Chaiwale kaka ke paas ek hi recipe thi: **2 cup paani aur 1 cup doodh**. Ek chhote pot mein 2 cup paani aur 1 cup doodh; bade pot mein 6 cup paani aur 3 cup doodh; shaadi ke order mein 60 cup paani aur 30 cup doodh. Pot kitna bhi bada ho, **ratio 2 : 1 hi rehta hai**.\n\nSanchi ne hisaab lagaya: \"Mama, chhote pot mein kul 3 cup, bade mein 9 cup. Par ratio hamesha 2 : 1. Kaka ko kabhi 'saade teen cup paani' ya 'ek aur chauthai cup doodh' nahi chahiye hota!\" Mr. Zende hanse: \"Bilkul. Ab ek ajeeb baat suno. Gaso ke reaction mein bhi aisa hi hota hai. Hydrogen aur oxygen milkar steam banate hain: **2 litre hydrogen ko hamesha 1 litre oxygen chahiye**, 2 litre steam bante hain. 20 litre hydrogen ho to 10 litre oxygen. Kabhi 'saade 1.37 litre' nahi. Chai ki recipe ki tarah **gaso ki bhi ek recipe hoti hai, aur wo volume mein likhi jaati hai**.\"\n\nSanchi ne puchha: \"Par Mama, chai ka ratio to kaka ki marzi se hai. Gas ko kaun batata hai ki 2 : 1 hi lena hai?\" Yahi is topic ka sawaal hai: gaso ki recipe **kaun likhta hai**, aur wo hamesha poori sankhya mein kyun aati hai?\n\n**Ghar par adult ke saath (chai banaye bina):** do alag size ke glass ya katori lo. Ek ko \"ek cup\" maan kar thanda paani aur thanda doodh 2 : 1 mein milao. Phir doosri size ki katori ko \"ek cup\" maano aur wahi ratio dohrao. Jab tak **ek hi katori** se dono naapte ho, ratio 2 : 1 rehta hai. Do alag size ki katori se naapoge to ratio bigad jayega. Is topic mein bhi, **sab gaso ke volume ek hi taapman aur dabao par** naapne honge, warna ratio bigad jayega.\n\n(Hot chai ya gas par kuch bhi sirf adult banata hai. Is topic mein koi gas ka reaction karna nahi hai: sab **sirf padhne ke liye, kagaz par** hai.)",
