            "headingHinglish": "Mela ka gubbare wala",
            "body": "Mr. Sapkal apne bhatije Ranveer ko gaon ke mela mein le gaye. Ek jagah bhaari bheed thi: ek **gubbare wala** apne stall par rang-birange gubbare bech raha tha. Ranveer ne ek ajeeb baat dekhi. Kuch gubbare dhaage se bandhe hue **seedhe upar** tair rahe the, jaise aasman ko chhoo rahe hon. Aur kuch gubbare stall ke bans se bandhe hue **neeche jhool** rahe the, bas kuch inch upar, aur zara hawa chali to idhar-udhar ladkhadate rahe.\n\nStall ke peeche ek bhaari dhaatu ka **cylinder** rakha tha. Gubbare wale bhaiya ne ek gubbare ka munh cylinder ke nozzle se lagaya, valve haule se khola, aur gubbara phoolkar tairne laga. Dusre gubbare unhone **hath ke pump** se phulaye the. \"Upar jaane wale **helium** ke hain, bachcha,\" unhone Ranveer se kaha. \"Neeche wale mein sirf **hawa** hai.\"\n\nRanveer ne Mr. Sapkal ki kameez kheenchi. \"Chacha, dono mein gas hi hai. Phir ek upar, ek neeche? Aur bhaiya helium ko 'halki' kehte hain, to ye **kitni halki** hai? Hum ise kaise naap sakte hain?\"\n\nMr. Sapkal muskuraye. \"Class 9 mein tune gas ki density padhi thi, grams per litre mein. Aaj ek aur aasan naap seekhte hain: kisi bhi gas ka **ek litre** lo, aur usi halat mein **hydrogen ka ek litre** lo. Dono ko tolo. Jo ratio aayega, wahi us gas ki halki-bhaari ka naap hai. Aur Avogadro ka niyam ise ek bahut simple number bana dega.\"\n\n> **Safety:** gubbare wale bhaiya cylinder khud sambhalte hain; hum sirf door se dekh rahe the. Gas cylinder koi bachcha kabhi nahi chhuta, na ghar par kabhi aisa kuch kiya jaata hai. Is poore topic mein har gas ka kaam **sirf kagaz par** hai. Jo gas zehreeli hain (H₂S, SO₂, Cl₂, NO₂, F₂, NH₃, HCl), unka zikr **sirf padhne ke liye** hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Sapkal apne bhatije Ranveer ko gaon ke mela mein le gaye. Ek jagah bhaari bheed thi: ek **gubbare wala** apne stall par rang-birange gubbare bech raha tha. Ranveer ne ek ajeeb baat dekhi. Kuch gubbare dhaage se bandhe hue **seedhe upar** tair rahe the, jaise aasman ko chhoo rahe hon. Aur kuch gubbare stall ke bans se bandhe hue **neeche jhool** rahe the, bas kuch inch upar, aur zara hawa chali to idhar-udhar ladkhadate rahe.\n\nStall ke peeche ek bhaari dhaatu ka **cylinder** rakha tha. Gubbare wale bhaiya ne ek gubbare ka munh cylinder ke nozzle se lagaya, valve haule se khola, aur gubbara phoolkar tairne laga. Dusre gubbare unhone **hath ke pump** se phulaye the. \"Upar jaane wale **helium** ke hain, bachcha,\" unhone Ranveer se kaha. \"Neeche wale mein sirf **hawa** hai.\"\n\nRanveer ne Mr. Sapkal ki kameez kheenchi. \"Chacha, dono mein gas hi hai. Phir ek upar, ek neeche? Aur bhaiya helium ko 'halki' kehte hain, to ye **kitni halki** hai? Hum ise kaise naap sakte hain?\"\n\nMr. Sapkal muskuraye. \"Class 9 mein tune gas ki density padhi thi, grams per litre mein. Aaj ek aur aasan naap seekhte hain: kisi bhi gas ka **ek litre** lo, aur usi halat mein **hydrogen ka ek litre** lo. Dono ko tolo. Jo ratio aayega, wahi us gas ki halki-bhaari ka naap hai. Aur Avogadro ka niyam ise ek bahut simple number bana dega.\"\n\n> **Safety:** gubbare wale bhaiya cylinder khud sambhalte hain; hum sirf door se dekh rahe the. Gas cylinder koi bachcha kabhi nahi chhuta, na ghar par kabhi aisa kuch kiya jaata hai. Is poore topic mein har gas ka kaam **sirf kagaz par** hai. Jo gas zehreeli hain (H₂S, SO₂, Cl₂, NO₂, F₂, NH₃, HCl), unka zikr **sirf padhne ke liye** hai."
