            "body": "Topic 4 mein humne seekha ki balanced equation moles ki recipe hai, aur mass se mass tak ka rasta **mass → mole → ratio → mole → mass** hai. Par bahut si reactions mein **gas** nikalti hai ya lagti hai, aur gas ko tarazu par tolna mushkil hai: usse naapna aasaan hota hai **volume** (litre) mein. Class 9 mein humne jaana tha ki STP par **1 mole gas = 22.4 L**. Is topic mein wahi 22.4 L mole ke pul ke **doosre kinare** par lagta hai: ab hum **mass se volume**, **volume se mass** aur **volume se volume** tak ke sawaal hal karenge, ghar ke cooking-gas burner ko kitni hawa chahiye ye bhi, aur aakhir mein ek poora **naksha (map)** banayenge jisme mass, mole, volume aur kan, sab ek jagah hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 4 mein humne seekha ki balanced equation moles ki recipe hai, aur mass se mass tak ka rasta **mass → mole → ratio → mole → mass** hai. Par bahut si reactions mein **gas** nikalti hai ya lagti hai, aur gas ko tarazu par tolna mushkil hai: usse naapna aasaan hota hai **volume** (litre) mein. Class 9 mein humne jaana tha ki STP par **1 mole gas = 22.4 L**. Is topic mein wahi 22.4 L mole ke pul ke **doosre kinare** par lagta hai: ab hum **mass se volume**, **volume se mass** aur **volume se volume** tak ke sawaal hal karenge, ghar ke cooking-gas burner ko kitni hawa chahiye ye bhi, aur aakhir mein ek poora **naksha (map)** banayenge jisme mass, mole, volume aur kan, sab ek jagah hain."
