            "heading": "Naye shabd",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **STP** | Gas ki naap ki \"standard\" sthiti: 273 K (0 °C) aur 1 atm dabao | Class 9 ka 22.4 L isi par sach hai |\n| **Molar volume** | 1 mole gas ka volume STP par: 22.4 L | 1 mol O₂ = 22.4 L, 1 mol CO₂ = 22.4 L |\n| **Mass-volume sawaal** | Jisme diya mass (g) ho aur poocha gas ka volume (L), ya ulta | 21.2 g Na₂CO₃ se kitni CO₂ |\n| **Volume-volume sawaal** | Jisme diya aur poocha, dono gas ke volume hain | 6 L ethene ko kitni O₂ |\n| **Mole map** | Mass, mole, volume aur kan ko jodne wala naksha | Figure 5.1 |\n| **Hawa mein O₂ ka hissa** | Hawa mein lagbhag 21% volume O₂ aur lagbhag 78% N₂ hota hai | 100 L hawa mein lagbhag 21 L O₂ |\n| **Bhaap (steam)** | 100 °C ke upar ki paani ki gas: ye liquid paani se bilkul alag volume leti hai | 18 g paani = lagbhag 18 mL, par 18 g bhaap bahut zyada jagah |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **STP** | Gas ki naap ki \"standard\" sthiti: 273 K (0 °C) aur 1 atm dabao | Class 9 ka 22.4 L isi par sach hai |\n| **Molar volume** | 1 mole gas ka volume STP par: 22.4 L | 1 mol O₂ = 22.4 L, 1 mol CO₂ = 22.4 L |\n| **Mass-volume sawaal** | Jisme diya mass (g) ho aur poocha gas ka volume (L), ya ulta | 21.2 g Na₂CO₃ se kitni CO₂ |\n| **Volume-volume sawaal** | Jisme diya aur poocha, dono gas ke volume hain | 6 L ethene ko kitni O₂ |\n| **Mole map** | Mass, mole, volume aur kan ko jodne wala naksha | Figure 5.1 |\n| **Hawa mein O₂ ka hissa** | Hawa mein lagbhag 21% volume O₂ aur lagbhag 78% N₂ hota hai | 100 L hawa mein lagbhag 21 L O₂ |\n| **Bhaap (steam)** | 100 °C ke upar ki paani ki gas: ye liquid paani se bilkul alag volume leti hai | 18 g paani = lagbhag 18 mL, par 18 g bhaap bahut zyada jagah |"
