            "heading": "Chapter Ka Saar: Mole Concept and Stoichiometry",
            "headingHinglish": "Chapter Ka Saar: Mole Concept and Stoichiometry",
            "body": "Chhe topics ka safar ek nazar mein: gas ke volume ka ginti ka niyam, gas ka halka-bhari naap, formula kaise nikalte hain, equation recipe ki tarah, volume aur mole ka saath, aur aakhir mein sab kuch ek master method mein.\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Gay-Lussac aur Avogadro: gas ka ginti ka niyam | Gas aapas mein aur apne products ke saath simple whole-number volume ratio mein react karte hain (same T aur P); Avogadro ka niyam isse samjhata hai (barabar volume, barabar molecules); atomicity (He mono, H₂ O₂ N₂ Cl₂ di, O₃ tri, P₄ S₈ poly) aur adhe molecule ki paheli; volume ratio ke sawaal. |\n| Topic 2 | Vapour density: gas ka halka-bhari naap | VD = (gas ka mass) ÷ (utne hi volume hydrogen ka mass) = M ÷ 2; M = 2 × VD; VD ki koi ikai nahi; hawa (M lagbhag 29) se halki ya bhaari gas: balloon kyun uthta ya baithta hai; gas leak alarm ki jagah. |\n| Topic 3 | Empirical aur molecular formula | Empirical formula sabse chhota whole-number ratio; molecular formula = empirical × n, n = molecular mass ÷ empirical mass; percentage se paanch kadam; whole-number ki trick; ionic compounds mein sirf formula unit. |\n| Topic 4 | Equation ek recipe hai: mass se mass tak | Balanced equation moles ki recipe hai, masses ki nahi; mole ratio method; conservation of mass se check; kan, mass se; recipe ko scale karna; masses ka seedha ratio galat hai. |\n| Topic 5 | Gas ke volume aur mole ke saath calculations | 22.4 L har mole gas ke liye at STP; mass se volume, volume se mass, volume se volume; hawa ki zaroorat (lagbhag 21% oxygen); mass, volume, kan ka mole map; 22.4 L liquid aur solid ke liye nahi; cooking gas ki safety. |\n| Topic 6 | Sab kuch mila kar: practice aur chapter ka saar | Paanch kadam ka master method (balance, mole ratio, mole mein, hisaab, check); nau mixed solved problems jo Chapter 1 se 4 ki reactions ko Topic 1 se 5 se jodte hain; paanch aam galtiyan; buzzer round. |\n\n---\n\nCount Karo ke finals mein Saee ki team ne buzzer round mein sabse zyada number jeete. Jab Mr. Mhatre ne phir pucha \"do mole paani ka mass?\", Saee ne ek second ruk kar kaha: \"**36 gram**: do mole, har mole 18 gram.\" Poora hall taaliyon se goonj utha. Mr. Mhatre ne dheere se kaha, \"Dekha? Jaldi nahi, kram.\"\n\nTumne Chapter 5 ke saare 6 topics poore kar liye: ab tum gas, mass aur kan ko mole ke pul se jod kar kisi bhi equation ko recipe ki tarah padh sakte ho.\n\n**Agle Chapter Mein Kya Hai?** Chapter 6 Periodic Properties: kuch atom bade, kuch chhote kyun hote hain, sodium apna electron itni aasani se kyun de deta hai aur chlorine ek ko kyun grab kar leta hai: ek niyam jo poori periodic table ko samjha deta hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Chhe topics ka safar ek nazar mein: gas ke volume ka ginti ka niyam, gas ka halka-bhari naap, formula kaise nikalte hain, equation recipe ki tarah, volume aur mole ka saath, aur aakhir mein sab kuch ek master method mein.\n\n| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| Topic 1 | Gay-Lussac aur Avogadro: gas ka ginti ka niyam | Gas aapas mein aur apne products ke saath simple whole-number volume ratio mein react karte hain (same T aur P); Avogadro ka niyam isse samjhata hai (barabar volume, barabar molecules); atomicity (He mono, H₂ O₂ N₂ Cl₂ di, O₃ tri, P₄ S₈ poly) aur adhe molecule ki paheli; volume ratio ke sawaal. |\n| Topic 2 | Vapour density: gas ka halka-bhari naap | VD = (gas ka mass) ÷ (utne hi volume hydrogen ka mass) = M ÷ 2; M = 2 × VD; VD ki koi ikai nahi; hawa (M lagbhag 29) se halki ya bhaari gas: balloon kyun uthta ya baithta hai; gas leak alarm ki jagah. |\n| Topic 3 | Empirical aur molecular formula | Empirical formula sabse chhota whole-number ratio; molecular formula = empirical × n, n = molecular mass ÷ empirical mass; percentage se paanch kadam; whole-number ki trick; ionic compounds mein sirf formula unit. |\n| Topic 4 | Equation ek recipe hai: mass se mass tak | Balanced equation moles ki recipe hai, masses ki nahi; mole ratio method; conservation of mass se check; kan, mass se; recipe ko scale karna; masses ka seedha ratio galat hai. |\n| Topic 5 | Gas ke volume aur mole ke saath calculations | 22.4 L har mole gas ke liye at STP; mass se volume, volume se mass, volume se volume; hawa ki zaroorat (lagbhag 21% oxygen); mass, volume, kan ka mole map; 22.4 L liquid aur solid ke liye nahi; cooking gas ki safety. |\n| Topic 6 | Sab kuch mila kar: practice aur chapter ka saar | Paanch kadam ka master method (balance, mole ratio, mole mein, hisaab, check); nau mixed solved problems jo Chapter 1 se 4 ki reactions ko Topic 1 se 5 se jodte hain; paanch aam galtiyan; buzzer round. |\n\n---\n\nCount Karo ke finals mein Saee ki team ne buzzer round mein sabse zyada number jeete. Jab Mr. Mhatre ne phir pucha \"do mole paani ka mass?\", Saee ne ek second ruk kar kaha: \"**36 gram**: do mole, har mole 18 gram.\" Poora hall taaliyon se goonj utha. Mr. Mhatre ne dheere se kaha, \"Dekha? Jaldi nahi, kram.\"\n\nTumne Chapter 5 ke saare 6 topics poore kar liye: ab tum gas, mass aur kan ko mole ke pul se jod kar kisi bhi equation ko recipe ki tarah padh sakte ho.\n\n**Agle Chapter Mein Kya Hai?** Chapter 6 Periodic Properties: kuch atom bade, kuch chhote kyun hote hain, sodium apna electron itni aasani se kyun de deta hai aur chlorine ek ko kyun grab kar leta hai: ek niyam jo poori periodic table ko samjha deta hai."
