            "headingHinglish": "Fridge ka magnet aur kaapi ke panne",
            "body": "Mr. Kshirsagar ki bhanji Shalaka chhutti mein unke ghar aayi thi. Fridge ke darwaaze par ek chhota sa gol magnet laga tha. Shalaka ne uske neeche ek kaapi ka panna daba diya aur magnet ne use pakad liya. Phir doosra, phir teesra. Teen panne tak magnet ki pakad theek thi.\n\n\"Mama, ab main aur panne daalti hoon,\" Shalaka ne kaha. Mr. Kshirsagar ne haath neeche rakh liya: \"Dhyan se, magnet gir sakta hai. Aur ye sirf bade ke saamne karna.\" Shalaka ne 10 panne rakhe, phir 20. Ek samay aaya ki magnet **dheela** pad gaya aur khisak kar haath mein aa gira, jabki fridge ka darwaaza wahi tha aur magnet bhi wahi.\n\n\"Magnet kamzor to nahi hua, Mama. Phir chhoot kyun gaya?\" Mr. Kshirsagar ne samjhaya: \"Magnet aur fridge ke beech jitni zyada **parten** (layers) aati gayin, magnet ki khinchne ki taaqat fridge tak utni kam pahunchi. Taaqat wahi thi, par beech mein rukawat aur doori badh gayi.\"\n\nShalaka ne chunauti li, \"To Mama, ye atom mein bhi hota hoga?\" Mr. Kshirsagar muskuraye. \"Bilkul. Nucleus ek magnet jaisa hai jo baahari electron ko kheenchta hai. Beech ki bhari shells wo panne hain. Chalo, dekhte hain ki is picture se atom ka size kaise tay hota hai.\"",
