            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Atomic radius** | Atom ke nucleus se baahari shell tak ki lagbhag doori, picometre (pm) mein | Na ka lagbhag 186 pm |\n| **Picometre (pm)** | Bahut chhoti lambai: 1 pm = 10⁻¹² m | 100 pm = 0.1 nm |\n| **Nuclear pull** | Nucleus ke protons ka baahari electron ko apni taraf kheenchna | Zyada protons, zyada pull |\n| **Shielding (parda)** | Beech ki bhari shells ke electrons ka baahari electron tak pahunchne wali pull ko kam kar dena | Panne jo magnet aur fridge ke beech hain |\n| **Ionic radius** | Ion ka size (nucleus se uski baahari shell tak ki lagbhag doori) | Na⁺ ka lagbhag 102 pm |\n| **Cation** | Electron khokar bana positive ion | Na⁺, Mg²⁺ |\n| **Anion** | Electron lekar bana negative ion | Cl⁻, O²⁻ |\n| **Isoelectronic** | Aise atoms ya ions jinke electrons ki ginti barabar ho | O²⁻, F⁻, Na⁺, Mg²⁺: sab ke 10 electron |",
