            "correctIndex": 3,
            "explanation": "Pitfall to avoid (\"Jis atom mein zyada electrons hain, wo hamesha bada hota hai.\"): Ye galat hai, aur ye is topic ki sabse badi galti hai. Gin ke dekho: - Mg mein 12 electrons aur S mein 16 electrons. Par Mg lagbhag 160 pm aur S lagbhag 103 pm: kam electron wala bada. Kaaran: dono ke 3 shells hain, par S mein 16 protons hain aur wahi shells zyada khinchi hain. - Li (3 electrons) lagbhag 152 pm, F (9 electrons) lagbhag 64 pm: yahan bhi zyada electron wala chhota. - O²⁻ mein 10 electrons aur Mg²⁺ mein bhi 10 electrons: electrons barabar, par size lagbhag 140 aur 72 pm (Part G). - K⁺ mein 18 electrons aur K mein 19 electrons: zyada electron wala (K) bada hai (227 pm aur 138 pm). Yahan kaaran ye hai ki ek poori shell zyada hai. To size electrons ki ginti se nahi, shells aur bachi hui pull (Part A) se tay hota hai. Electrons ki ginti kabhi-kabhi sahi nateeja deti hai, par sirf sanyog se.",
            "explanationHinglish": "Bachke rehna (\"Jis atom mein zyada electrons hain, wo hamesha bada hota hai.\"): Ye galat hai, aur ye is topic ki sabse badi galti hai. Gin ke dekho: - Mg mein 12 electrons aur S mein 16 electrons. Par Mg lagbhag 160 pm aur S lagbhag 103 pm: kam electron wala bada. Kaaran: dono ke 3 shells hain, par S mein 16 protons hain aur wahi shells zyada khinchi hain. - Li (3 electrons) lagbhag 152 pm, F (9 electrons) lagbhag 64 pm: yahan bhi zyada electron wala chhota. - O²⁻ mein 10 electrons aur Mg²⁺ mein bhi 10 electrons: electrons barabar, par size lagbhag 140 aur 72 pm (Part G). - K⁺ mein 18 electrons aur K mein 19 electrons: zyada electron wala (K) bada hai (227 pm aur 138 pm). Yahan kaaran ye hai ki ek poori shell zyada hai. To size electrons ki ginti se nahi, shells aur bachi hui pull (Part A) se tay hota hai. Electrons ki ginti kabhi-kabhi sahi nateeja deti hai, par sirf sanyog se."
