            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein humne atom ka size dekha aur Topic 2 mein ek atom se electron **nikaalne** ki keemat (ionisation energy). Ab sikke ka doosra pehlu: kuch atom electron dene mein nakhre dikhate hain, par kuch to electron **lene** ke liye utaawle rehte hain. Is topic mein hum naapte hain ki ek atom electron pakadne par kitni energy **chhodta** hai, aur dekhte hain ki halogen itne \"josheele\" aur noble gas itne \"bepervah\" kyun hain. Dono topic mein bas ek hi do ideas kaam karenge: **shells ki ginti (doori)** aur **nuclear pull (shielding ke baad)**."
