            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **4-step method** | Kisi bhi \"arrange and explain\" sawaal ke liye chaar kadam: shells ginna, nuclear pull dekhna, trend likhna, reason likhna | Is topic ka Part A |\n| **Valence electrons** | Baahari shell ke electrons: bond aur valency inhi se bante hain | Cl mein 7 |\n| **Inner (core) electrons** | Baahari shell ke andar ke bhare hue electrons: ye shielding dete hain | Cl mein 2 + 8 = 10 |\n| **Jump (chhalaang)** | Successive ionisation energies mein achanak bahut bada kood | Be mein teesri energy bahut badi |\n| **Isoelectronic** | Jin ions ya atoms mein electrons ki ginti ek jaisi ho | N³⁻, F⁻, Al³⁺ (sab mein 10) |\n| **Trend map** | Ek period aur ek group mein saari properties ke arrows ek jagah | Figure 6.5 |\n| **Case study** | Ek hi tatvon ki poori fauj ko saari properties ke saath ek table mein dekhna | Period 3 ki table |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **4-step method** | Kisi bhi \"arrange and explain\" sawaal ke liye chaar kadam: shells ginna, nuclear pull dekhna, trend likhna, reason likhna | Is topic ka Part A |\n| **Valence electrons** | Baahari shell ke electrons: bond aur valency inhi se bante hain | Cl mein 7 |\n| **Inner (core) electrons** | Baahari shell ke andar ke bhare hue electrons: ye shielding dete hain | Cl mein 2 + 8 = 10 |\n| **Jump (chhalaang)** | Successive ionisation energies mein achanak bahut bada kood | Be mein teesri energy bahut badi |\n| **Isoelectronic** | Jin ions ya atoms mein electrons ki ginti ek jaisi ho | N³⁻, F⁻, Al³⁺ (sab mein 10) |\n| **Trend map** | Ek period aur ek group mein saari properties ke arrows ek jagah | Figure 6.5 |\n| **Case study** | Ek hi tatvon ki poori fauj ko saari properties ke saath ek table mein dekhna | Period 3 ki table |"
