            "heading": "Part C: Chalk-chart activity (maidan mein, aur ghar mein bhi)",
            "headingHinglish": "Part C: Chalk-chart activity (maidan mein, aur ghar mein bhi)",
            "body": "Ye activity school ke maidan mein ya ghar ke aangan mein ki ja sakti hai. Koi hazardous cheez nahi, sirf chalk aur cards.\n\n**Chahiye:** chalk (zameen par chalne wali), rassi ya measuring tape, 18 card jin par tatva ke symbol aur proton count hon, aur ek bada (adult ya teacher) paas mein.\n\n**Safety:** chalk ki dhool saans mein na jaaye (phoonk kar na udaao), kaam ke baad haath dho lo. Zameen geeli ya phisalan wali ho to activity na karo. Daudna nahi, sirf chalna.\n\n**Karna kya hai:**\n1. Figure 6.1 jaisa 3 row × 8 column ka table banao (har dabba 1 metre).\n2. Har bacha ek card leta hai aur apne dabbe mein khada hota hai.\n3. **Period walk:** Na se Cl tak dheere chalo. Har dabba par ruk kar bolo: \"protons ek zyada, shells wahi.\" Bacha jo Cl par khada hai apne haath ko Na wale bacche se thoda kam failaata hai (radius kam): chhota size dikhane ke liye.\n4. **Group walk:** Li se Na tak jao (Group 1 mein neeche). Har kadam par ek aur \"shell ring\" (rassi ka gol) badhao: baahari electron aur door ho gaya, to size bada.\n5. **Pull game:** do bacche, ek Na wala aur ek Cl wala, ek rassi ko dono taraf se halke se kheenchte hain (adult paas mein, kheench sirf thodi). Cl wala zyada \"pull-token\" (cards) pakadta hai: use rassi apni taraf laana aasaan lagega. Yeh EN ka khel hai: jis ke paas zyada pull, wo shared rassi apni taraf zyada laata hai.\n\n```\n   Na  Mg  Al  Si  P   S   Cl\n   --> protons badhte hain, shells ek jaisi (3)\n   --> size ghat-ta hai, EN badhti hai\n   --> baayen se daayen: dhatu se non-metal\n```\n\n> **Figure 6.4** – Ek period ke par chalne ka summary: protons badhte hain, shells ek jaisi hain. Isi liye size ghat-ta hai, EN badhti hai, aur character dhatu se non-metal ki taraf jaata hai.\n\nChacha ne jab bacchon ko baar-baar \"Na se Cl\" chalte dekha, to bola: \"Ab ek aur dimaagi kaam: kisi ek tatva ke dabbe par khade ho kar bolo ki apne padosi se tum kaise alag ho: left, right, upar, neeche. Chaar disha, chaar jawab.\" Tanuja ne N ka dabba chuna: left C (bada, kam EN), right O (chhota, zyada EN), neeche P (bada, kam EN), upar koi nahi (Period 1 mein is Group mein koi nahi). Chacha ne taali bajai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ye activity school ke maidan mein ya ghar ke aangan mein ki ja sakti hai. Koi hazardous cheez nahi, sirf chalk aur cards.\n\n**Chahiye:** chalk (zameen par chalne wali), rassi ya measuring tape, 18 card jin par tatva ke symbol aur proton count hon, aur ek bada (adult ya teacher) paas mein.\n\n**Safety:** chalk ki dhool saans mein na jaaye (phoonk kar na udaao), kaam ke baad haath dho lo. Zameen geeli ya phisalan wali ho to activity na karo. Daudna nahi, sirf chalna.\n\n**Karna kya hai:**\n1. Figure 6.1 jaisa 3 row × 8 column ka table banao (har dabba 1 metre).\n2. Har bacha ek card leta hai aur apne dabbe mein khada hota hai.\n3. **Period walk:** Na se Cl tak dheere chalo. Har dabba par ruk kar bolo: \"protons ek zyada, shells wahi.\" Bacha jo Cl par khada hai apne haath ko Na wale bacche se thoda kam failaata hai (radius kam): chhota size dikhane ke liye.\n4. **Group walk:** Li se Na tak jao (Group 1 mein neeche). Har kadam par ek aur \"shell ring\" (rassi ka gol) badhao: baahari electron aur door ho gaya, to size bada.\n5. **Pull game:** do bacche, ek Na wala aur ek Cl wala, ek rassi ko dono taraf se halke se kheenchte hain (adult paas mein, kheench sirf thodi). Cl wala zyada \"pull-token\" (cards) pakadta hai: use rassi apni taraf laana aasaan lagega. Yeh EN ka khel hai: jis ke paas zyada pull, wo shared rassi apni taraf zyada laata hai.\n\n```\n   Na  Mg  Al  Si  P   S   Cl\n   --> protons badhte hain, shells ek jaisi (3)\n   --> size ghat-ta hai, EN badhti hai\n   --> baayen se daayen: dhatu se non-metal\n```\n\n> **Figure 6.4** – Ek period ke par chalne ka summary: protons badhte hain, shells ek jaisi hain. Isi liye size ghat-ta hai, EN badhti hai, aur character dhatu se non-metal ki taraf jaata hai.\n\nChacha ne jab bacchon ko baar-baar \"Na se Cl\" chalte dekha, to bola: \"Ab ek aur dimaagi kaam: kisi ek tatva ke dabbe par khade ho kar bolo ki apne padosi se tum kaise alag ho: left, right, upar, neeche. Chaar disha, chaar jawab.\" Tanuja ne N ka dabba chuna: left C (bada, kam EN), right O (chhota, zyada EN), neeche P (bada, kam EN), upar koi nahi (Period 1 mein is Group mein koi nahi). Chacha ne taali bajai."
