            "bodyHinglish": "```\n   Ek PERIOD mein (left -> right)         Ek GROUP mein (upar -> neeche)\n\n   Shells         wahi                    Shells         badhti hain\n   Protons        badhte hain             Protons        badhte hain\n   Atomic size    ghat-ta hai             Atomic size    badhta hai\n   Ionisation E.  badhti hai              Ionisation E.  ghat-ti hai\n   Electron aff.  badhti hai*             Electron aff.  ghat-ti hai\n   Electronegat.  badhti hai              Electronegat.  ghat-ti hai\n   Metallic char. ghat-ta hai             Metallic char. badhta hai\n   Non-met. char. badhta hai              Non-met. char. ghat-ta hai\n   Metal reactiv. ghat-ti hai             Metal reactiv. badhti hai\n   Non-metal r.   badhti hai              Non-metal r.   ghat-ti hai\n```\n\n> **Figure 6.5** – Trend map. Dono column zyaadatar ek-doosre ke ulte hain, par sab nahi: protons dono mein badhte hain, aur shells ya valence electrons ka trend ulta nahi (Aam galti 2 dekhein). *Noble gases ki EA lagbhag 0 hai, isliye \"badhti hai\" noble gas se pehle tak. Reactivity ke kaaran Topic 5 mein dekhe the."
