            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Non-polar covalent bond** | Aisa covalent bond jisme shared pair lagbhag theek beech mein rehta hai (dono atom ki kheench barabar ya lagbhag barabar) | F–F mein, C–H mein (bahut thoda farq) |\n| **Polar covalent bond** | Aisa covalent bond jisme shared pair zyada electronegative atom ki taraf khisak jaata hai, par baanta hua hi rehta hai | H–Cl, H–F |\n| **δ⁺ (delta plus)** | Atom par aayi **thodi si** positive charge (poori ek charge se bahut kam), kyunki pair uski taraf kam rehta hai | HCl mein H |\n| **δ⁻ (delta minus)** | Atom par aayi **thodi si** negative charge, kyunki pair uske paas zyada rehta hai | HCl mein Cl |\n| **Partial charge** | Poori charge nahi, sirf ek chhota sa hissa: δ⁺ ya δ⁻ | δ⁺ aur δ⁻ |\n| **Electronegativity ka farq** | Bond ke do atomon ki electronegativity ka bada minus chhota (Chapter 6, Topic 4), hamesha positive sankhya | H–Cl: 3.0 − 2.1 = 0.9 |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Non-polar covalent bond** | Aisa covalent bond jisme shared pair lagbhag theek beech mein rehta hai (dono atom ki kheench barabar ya lagbhag barabar) | F–F mein, C–H mein (bahut thoda farq) |\n| **Polar covalent bond** | Aisa covalent bond jisme shared pair zyada electronegative atom ki taraf khisak jaata hai, par baanta hua hi rehta hai | H–Cl, H–F |\n| **δ⁺ (delta plus)** | Atom par aayi **thodi si** positive charge (poori ek charge se bahut kam), kyunki pair uski taraf kam rehta hai | HCl mein H |\n| **δ⁻ (delta minus)** | Atom par aayi **thodi si** negative charge, kyunki pair uske paas zyada rehta hai | HCl mein Cl |\n| **Partial charge** | Poori charge nahi, sirf ek chhota sa hissa: δ⁺ ya δ⁻ | δ⁺ aur δ⁻ |\n| **Electronegativity ka farq** | Bond ke do atomon ki electronegativity ka bada minus chhota (Chapter 6, Topic 4), hamesha positive sankhya | H–Cl: 3.0 − 2.1 = 0.9 |"
