            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Ab tak humne bond ko ek-ek karke dekha: Class 9 mein ionic (de-le) aur covalent (baanto), is chapter mein polar covalent (barabar nahi baanta) aur coordinate (ek ne dono electron diye). Dikkat ye hai ki asli compounds aksar **sirf ek tarah ke bond se nahi bane hote**. Ek hi formula ke andar **do ya teen tarah ke bond** saath rehte hain, jaise ek bade model ke andar chhote-chhote models. Aaj hum yahi dekhenge: bond ginna aur batana ki **kaun sa bond kahan hai**.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ab tak humne bond ko ek-ek karke dekha: Class 9 mein ionic (de-le) aur covalent (baanto), is chapter mein polar covalent (barabar nahi baanta) aur coordinate (ek ne dono electron diye). Dikkat ye hai ki asli compounds aksar **sirf ek tarah ke bond se nahi bane hote**. Ek hi formula ke andar **do ya teen tarah ke bond** saath rehte hain, jaise ek bade model ke andar chhote-chhote models. Aaj hum yahi dekhenge: bond ginna aur batana ki **kaun sa bond kahan hai**."
