            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Polyatomic ion** | Kayi atoms covalent bond se jude hue ek jhund, jiske upar ek kul charge hai aur jo ek ion ki tarah behave karta hai | OH⁻, NH₄⁺ |\n| **Hydroxide ion** | O aur H ka jhund jiske upar 1 extra electron ka −1 charge hai | OH⁻ (NaOH, KOH mein) |\n| **Ammonium ion** | N aur 4 H ka jhund jiske upar +1 charge hai (Topic 3 wala NH₄⁺) | NH₄⁺ (NH₄Cl mein) |\n| **Ionic bond (ions ke beech)** | Ulte charge wale ions ka aakarshan, chahe ion ek atom ka ho ya atoms ke jhund ka | Na⁺ aur OH⁻ ke beech |\n| **Bracket wala formula** | Jab ek polyatomic ion ek se zyada baar aaye to uske chaaron taraf bracket aur bahar chhoti sankhya | Ca(OH)₂: 1 Ca aur 2 OH |\n| **Teen kisam ke bond** | Ek hi compound mein ionic, saadha covalent aur coordinate teeno | NH₄Cl |",
