            "body": "Topic 1 se Topic 4 tak humne bond ke kai chehre dekhe: **polar covalent** (pair ek taraf jhuka hua), **molecule ki polarity** (shape ka khel aur paani mein ghulna), **coordinate bond** (ek hi ne diye dono electron) aur ek compound mein **teen bond** saath-saath. Class 9 mein ionic aur covalent ke gun ek table mein aaye the; aaj hum usi table ko **gehra** karenge. Ab hamare paas chaar bond ke naam hain, electronegativity ka farq hai, aur polar-nonpolar ki samajh hai. Is topic ka kaam: sab ko **ek master table** mein rakhna, aur har gun ke peeche ki **wajah** dhoondhna: kaun sa solid 801 °C par pighalta hai aur kaun sa gas -85 °C par bhi ubal jaata hai, kaun paani mein ghulta hai, aur kaun tootne par chatakta hai.",
