            "heading": "Kirana ki shelves aur ek sawaal",
            "headingHinglish": "Kirana ki shelves aur ek sawaal",
            "body": "Itwaar ki subah Mr. Kunte apni bhanji Nupur ko lekar mohalle ki kirana dukaan gaye. Ghar mein namak khatam ho gaya tha. Dukaan ki shelves par Nupur ki nazar ghoomi: ek dabbe mein namak, ek mein cheeni, ek botal mein khaane ka tel, ek shelf par mombattiyaan (wax ki candles), aur ek chhote packet mein baking soda. Tabhi ek aunty counter par aayin aur dukaandaar se boli, \"Bhaiya, ye sab cheezein ek glass paani mein daalo, to kaun-kaun ghul jaayegi? Mujhe ek nuskha banana hai.\" Dukaandaar kandhe uchkakar bola, \"Aunty, glass mein daal ke dekh lo.\"\n\nNupur ko mazaa aaya. \"Mama, kya hum bina daale hi bata sakte hain?\" Mr. Kunte muskuraye. \"Bilkul, agar tumne bond ko samjha hai. Har cheez ke andar ke **bond aur uski banawat** bata deti hai ki wo paani mein ghulegi ya nahi, kab pighlegi, aur bijli chalayegi ya nahi. Gun to bas bond ki **parchhai** hain.\" Nupur ne copy nikali. \"To aaj mein shelves ko bond ke hisaab se alag-alag karungi!\" \"Pehle ek master table banate hain,\" Mr. Kunte ne kaha, \"phir dukaan ki har shelf ko usme fit karenge.\"\n\n```\n   SHELF 1: namak      SHELF 2: cheeni      SHELF 3: tel\n   SHELF 4: mombatti   SHELF 5: baking soda\n\n   Sawaal: ek glass paani mein kaun ghulega? Kiski wajah kya?\n```\n\n> **Figure 5.1** – Kirana ki paanch shelves jinka hisaab hum is topic ke aakhir tak bond ke naam se lagayenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Itwaar ki subah Mr. Kunte apni bhanji Nupur ko lekar mohalle ki kirana dukaan gaye. Ghar mein namak khatam ho gaya tha. Dukaan ki shelves par Nupur ki nazar ghoomi: ek dabbe mein namak, ek mein cheeni, ek botal mein khaane ka tel, ek shelf par mombattiyaan (wax ki candles), aur ek chhote packet mein baking soda. Tabhi ek aunty counter par aayin aur dukaandaar se boli, \"Bhaiya, ye sab cheezein ek glass paani mein daalo, to kaun-kaun ghul jaayegi? Mujhe ek nuskha banana hai.\" Dukaandaar kandhe uchkakar bola, \"Aunty, glass mein daal ke dekh lo.\"\n\nNupur ko mazaa aaya. \"Mama, kya hum bina daale hi bata sakte hain?\" Mr. Kunte muskuraye. \"Bilkul, agar tumne bond ko samjha hai. Har cheez ke andar ke **bond aur uski banawat** bata deti hai ki wo paani mein ghulegi ya nahi, kab pighlegi, aur bijli chalayegi ya nahi. Gun to bas bond ki **parchhai** hain.\" Nupur ne copy nikali. \"To aaj mein shelves ko bond ke hisaab se alag-alag karungi!\" \"Pehle ek master table banate hain,\" Mr. Kunte ne kaha, \"phir dukaan ki har shelf ko usme fit karenge.\"\n\n```\n   SHELF 1: namak      SHELF 2: cheeni      SHELF 3: tel\n   SHELF 4: mombatti   SHELF 5: baking soda\n\n   Sawaal: ek glass paani mein kaun ghulega? Kiski wajah kya?\n```\n\n> **Figure 5.1** – Kirana ki paanch shelves jinka hisaab hum is topic ke aakhir tak bond ke naam se lagayenge."
