            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Lattice (jaali)** | Ions ka dhoor tak faila hua regular dhancha, jisme har ion ko chaaron taraf ke ulte charge wale ion pakde rehte hain | NaCl ka crystal |\n| **Molecule ka dher** | Alag-alag molecules, jo ek doosre ko sirf halke se pakadte hain | Methane gas ya wax |\n| **Pakad (attraction)** | Kan aur kan ke beech ki kheench: ye hi gun tay karti hai | Ions ke beech bahut zyada, molecules ke beech kam |\n| **Brittle** | Kadak par zor lagane par chatak kar tootne wala | Namak ka crystal |\n| **Soluble** | Jo ek liquid mein ghul kar milaa-jula rah jaaye | Cheeni paani mein |\n| **Giant covalent solid** | Aisa covalent solid jisme atom lagataar bond se jude hote hain, alag molecule nahi hote (sirf naam: diamond, ret) | Diamond |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Lattice (jaali)** | Ions ka dhoor tak faila hua regular dhancha, jisme har ion ko chaaron taraf ke ulte charge wale ion pakde rehte hain | NaCl ka crystal |\n| **Molecule ka dher** | Alag-alag molecules, jo ek doosre ko sirf halke se pakadte hain | Methane gas ya wax |\n| **Pakad (attraction)** | Kan aur kan ke beech ki kheench: ye hi gun tay karti hai | Ions ke beech bahut zyada, molecules ke beech kam |\n| **Brittle** | Kadak par zor lagane par chatak kar tootne wala | Namak ka crystal |\n| **Soluble** | Jo ek liquid mein ghul kar milaa-jula rah jaaye | Cheeni paani mein |\n| **Giant covalent solid** | Aisa covalent solid jisme atom lagataar bond se jude hote hain, alag molecule nahi hote (sirf naam: diamond, ret) | Diamond |"
