            "heading": "Bond Bingo",
            "headingHinglish": "Bond Bingo",
            "body": "Friday ko Mugdha ke school ke Science Club mein ek khel tha: **\"Bond Bingo\"**. Mugdha ke chacha, Mr. Mokashi, ko teacher ne caller banaya tha, aur Mugdha ko ek card mila jisme nau formulas the.\n\n```\n   [ CaF₂ ]     [ H₂S ]      [ KI ]\n   [ PH₃ ]      [ MgCl₂ ]    [ HI ]\n   [ CS₂ ]      [ AlCl₃ ]    [ SiH₄ ]\n```\n\n> **Figure 6.1** – Mugdha ka Bond Bingo card: nau formulas, nau cell. Caller ek clue padhta hai aur khiladi us cell par nishaan lagata hai jo clue se milta hai.\n\nKhel ka niyam alag tha: nishaan tabhi pakka, jab **kaaran** bhi bolo. Bina kaaran ke nishaan mita diya jaata. Mugdha ne kaha, \"Chacha, itne formulas, ratna to mushkil hai!\" Mr. Mokashi hanse. \"Ratna hai hi nahi. Chhe topics mein humne jo kuch sikha, use chaar sawaalon mein baandh lo. Har clue par wahi chaar sawaal poochho, aur jawab khud card par nishaan laga dega.\"\n\nMugdha ne pehla clue suna: \"Metal aur non-metal, farq bahut bada.\" Uska haath apne aap CaF₂ ki taraf gaya. Par kaaran? Wahi aaj hum banayenge.",
