            "heading": "Khud karke dekho: apna Bond Bingo (paper par)",
            "headingHinglish": "Khud karke dekho: apna Bond Bingo (paper par)",
            "body": "(Sirf kagaz aur pencil. Koi chemical nahi.)\n\nEk 3 x 3 ka card banao aur nau formulas likho jo is chapter mein aaye hain. Ek dost caller banega, aur clue sirf is tarah ke honge: \"farq 0 hai\", \"ek hi atom ne dono electron diye\", \"paani mein ions banate hain\". Har nishaan ke saath **ek line ka kaaran** likhna zaroori hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "(Sirf kagaz aur pencil. Koi chemical nahi.)\n\nEk 3 x 3 ka card banao aur nau formulas likho jo is chapter mein aaye hain. Ek dost caller banega, aur clue sirf is tarah ke honge: \"farq 0 hai\", \"ek hi atom ne dono electron diye\", \"paani mein ions banate hain\". Har nishaan ke saath **ek line ka kaaran** likhna zaroori hai."
