            "heading": "Chapter ka saar",
            "headingHinglish": "Chapter ka saar",
            "body": "| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. Polar Covalent Bond | Shared pair barabar nahi bhi baanta jaata hai; farq se δ⁺ aur δ⁻ | Zyada kheenchne wala atom δ⁻ hota hai, aur farq se bond ka swabhav dheere-dheere badalta hai |\n| 2. Polar aur Non-polar Molecule | Molecule ki polarity bonds aur shape dono par | Symmetric shape mein arrows kat jaate hain; like dissolves like |\n| 3. Coordinate Bond | Ek hi atom ke dono electron (donor se acceptor) | NH₄⁺ aur H₃O⁺ mein banne ke baad saare bond ek jaise |\n| 4. Ek Compound, Teen Bond | Polyatomic ion aur ek formula mein teeno bond | Ion ke bahar ionic, andar covalent aur coordinate |\n| 5. Sab Bonds Ki Tulna | Saare bonds ke gun aur unke karan | Structure se melting point, solubility aur conduction samajh aate hain |\n| 6. Sab Kuch Mila Kar | 4-step method, mixed puzzles aur galtiyan | Farq, metal ya non-metal, ion, lone pair, phir ginti |\n\nChemical Bonding ka safar yahan poora hua: ab tum kisi bhi simple formula ko dekh kar bata sakte ho ki uske andar kaun sa bond hai, kyun, aur uske gun kya honge.\n\n**Aage kya?** Chapter 8 Analytical Chemistry mein hum dekhenge ki kisi anjaan namak mein kaun sa metal ion chhupa hai, ye kaise pata chale: sodium hydroxide milao aur jo thos banta hai uska rang dekho, neela, hara, safed ya laal-bhura.",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. Polar Covalent Bond | Shared pair barabar nahi bhi baanta jaata hai; farq se δ⁺ aur δ⁻ | Zyada kheenchne wala atom δ⁻ hota hai, aur farq se bond ka swabhav dheere-dheere badalta hai |\n| 2. Polar aur Non-polar Molecule | Molecule ki polarity bonds aur shape dono par | Symmetric shape mein arrows kat jaate hain; like dissolves like |\n| 3. Coordinate Bond | Ek hi atom ke dono electron (donor se acceptor) | NH₄⁺ aur H₃O⁺ mein banne ke baad saare bond ek jaise |\n| 4. Ek Compound, Teen Bond | Polyatomic ion aur ek formula mein teeno bond | Ion ke bahar ionic, andar covalent aur coordinate |\n| 5. Sab Bonds Ki Tulna | Saare bonds ke gun aur unke karan | Structure se melting point, solubility aur conduction samajh aate hain |\n| 6. Sab Kuch Mila Kar | 4-step method, mixed puzzles aur galtiyan | Farq, metal ya non-metal, ion, lone pair, phir ginti |\n\nChemical Bonding ka safar yahan poora hua: ab tum kisi bhi simple formula ko dekh kar bata sakte ho ki uske andar kaun sa bond hai, kyun, aur uske gun kya honge.\n\n**Aage kya?** Chapter 8 Analytical Chemistry mein hum dekhenge ki kisi anjaan namak mein kaun sa metal ion chhupa hai, ye kaise pata chale: sodium hydroxide milao aur jo thos banta hai uska rang dekho, neela, hara, safed ya laal-bhura."
