            "body": "Pichhle topics mein hum namak ke **cation** (positive ion) ko NaOH aur NH₄OH se pehchanna seekh chuke hain. Par har namak ke do hisse hote hain (Chapter 1): ek cation aur ek **anion** (negative ion). Aadhi pehchaan abhi baaki hai. Aaj hum anion dhoondhenge: **chloride Cl⁻, sulphate SO₄²⁻, carbonate CO₃²⁻**, aur ek positive ion ko bhi, jo bahut khaas tareeke se pakda jaata hai: **ammonium NH₄⁺**.",
