            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Anjaan namak (unknown salt)** | Aisa namak jiska naam hume nahi pata aur jise tests se pehchaanna hai | Bina label ki botal ka namak |\n| **Observation table** | Har test ke saamne likhi hui \"kya dikha\" ki list | Test: NaOH drops. Dikha: laal-bhura precipitate |\n| **Cation test** | Positive ion pehchaanne ke tests (NaOH aur NH₄OH) | Cu²⁺: halka neela precipitate |\n| **Anion test** | Negative ion pehchaanne ke tests | Cl⁻: AgNO₃ se safed dahi jaisa precipitate |\n| **Charge-balance** | Formula aisa likhna ki kul positive charge aur kul negative charge barabar ho | Fe³⁺ aur SO₄²⁻ se Fe₂(SO₄)₃ |\n| **Elimination** | Ek-ek vikalp tests se hatana jab tak ek hi bache | Na Cl⁻, na SO₄²⁻: baaki nitrate |"
