            "headingHinglish": "Quick Recap",
            "body": "- **Master method:** dekho (rang), cation ka test (NaOH phir NH₄OH: boondein aur excess), anion ka test (alag hisse mein), naam aur formula (charge balance) aur equations.\n- **Cation table:** Ca²⁺ halka safed (nahi ghulta); Fe²⁺ ganda hara; Fe³⁺ laal-bhura; Cu²⁺ halka neela (NH₄OH excess mein gehra neela); Zn²⁺ safed (NaOH aur NH₄OH dono ke excess mein ghulta); Pb²⁺ aur Al³⁺ safed (NaOH excess mein ghulte, NH₄OH excess mein nahi).\n- **Anion:** Cl⁻ safed curdy AgCl (NH₄OH mein ghulta); SO₄²⁻ safed BaSO₄ (acid mein nahi ghulta); CO₃²⁻ bulbule aur chuna paani doodhiya; NH₄⁺ garam NaOH se tez gandh wali gas.\n- **Equations:** ionic pehle, spectator ions kaat kar; dhodha (s)↓, ghulansheel (aq).\n- **Kitna dhodha:** molar mass, mole, ratio, mass (Cu(NO₃)₂ 18.75 g se Cu(OH)₂ 9.75 g).\n- **Galtiyan:** excess ek saath mat daalo; reagent ka naam har natije ke saath likho; spectator ions kaato; dhodhe ko (s) likho.\n- Har test **school lab mein teacher ke saath** ya **teacher demo**; lead, barium, silver zehreele; ammonia fume cupboard mein; bacha hua ghol teacher ke hisse.",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Master method:** dekho (rang), cation ka test (NaOH phir NH₄OH: boondein aur excess), anion ka test (alag hisse mein), naam aur formula (charge balance) aur equations.\n- **Cation table:** Ca²⁺ halka safed (nahi ghulta); Fe²⁺ ganda hara; Fe³⁺ laal-bhura; Cu²⁺ halka neela (NH₄OH excess mein gehra neela); Zn²⁺ safed (NaOH aur NH₄OH dono ke excess mein ghulta); Pb²⁺ aur Al³⁺ safed (NaOH excess mein ghulte, NH₄OH excess mein nahi).\n- **Anion:** Cl⁻ safed curdy AgCl (NH₄OH mein ghulta); SO₄²⁻ safed BaSO₄ (acid mein nahi ghulta); CO₃²⁻ bulbule aur chuna paani doodhiya; NH₄⁺ garam NaOH se tez gandh wali gas.\n- **Equations:** ionic pehle, spectator ions kaat kar; dhodha (s)↓, ghulansheel (aq).\n- **Kitna dhodha:** molar mass, mole, ratio, mass (Cu(NO₃)₂ 18.75 g se Cu(OH)₂ 9.75 g).\n- **Galtiyan:** excess ek saath mat daalo; reagent ka naam har natije ke saath likho; spectator ions kaato; dhodhe ko (s) likho.\n- Har test **school lab mein teacher ke saath** ya **teacher demo**; lead, barium, silver zehreele; ammonia fume cupboard mein; bacha hua ghol teacher ke hisse."
