            "body": "| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Test, precipitate, ions ka hisaab, spectator ions | Har test mein teen sawaal: kya daala, kya dikha, matlab kya |\n| 2 | NaOH ke saath 7 cations ka rang aur excess mein behaviour | Zn²⁺, Pb²⁺, Al³⁺ ke dhodhe excess NaOH mein ghulte hain (amphoteric) |\n| 3 | NH₄OH ke saath wahi 7 cations, deep blue aur rangheen ghol | NH₄OH excess mein sirf Cu²⁺ (gehra neela) aur Zn²⁺ (rangheen) ghulte hain |\n| 4 | Anion aur ammonium ke test: Cl⁻, SO₄²⁻, CO₃²⁻, NH₄⁺ | Acid pehle, phir AgNO₃ ya BaCl₂; carbonate ko pehle hataana zaroori hai |\n| 5 | Anjaan namak ki khoj: sab tests saath | Rang dekho, ghulao, cation, anion, formula: dhyan se kram |\n| 6 | Master method, mile-jule puzzles, mass ka numerical, 4 aam galtiyan | Boond-boond daalo, reagent ka naam likho, spectator kaato, (s) likho |\n\n---\n\nNachiket ki team ne Mystery Box game day mein pehla inaam jeeta. Mr. Gunjal ne dher saare cards ko wapas ek rubber band mein bandhte hue kaha, \"Dekha, kram pakad liya to koi bhi bhool-bhulaiya sulajh jaati hai: dekho, cation, anion, likho.\" Nachiket ne cards ka dibba uthaya aur bola, \"Chacha, agle saal main apna Mystery Box khud banaunga!\"\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab agle Chapter 9 (Study of Compounds) mein hum dekhenge ki HCl, ammonia, nitric acid aur sulphuric acid jaise chemicals, jo factories lakhon tonne mein banati hain, kaise banaye jaate hain aur ye itne tez gandh wale, jalane wale aur daag chhodne wale kyun hote hain (sab kuch sirf padhne aur dekhne ke liye, student kabhi nahi banata).",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Test, precipitate, ions ka hisaab, spectator ions | Har test mein teen sawaal: kya daala, kya dikha, matlab kya |\n| 2 | NaOH ke saath 7 cations ka rang aur excess mein behaviour | Zn²⁺, Pb²⁺, Al³⁺ ke dhodhe excess NaOH mein ghulte hain (amphoteric) |\n| 3 | NH₄OH ke saath wahi 7 cations, deep blue aur rangheen ghol | NH₄OH excess mein sirf Cu²⁺ (gehra neela) aur Zn²⁺ (rangheen) ghulte hain |\n| 4 | Anion aur ammonium ke test: Cl⁻, SO₄²⁻, CO₃²⁻, NH₄⁺ | Acid pehle, phir AgNO₃ ya BaCl₂; carbonate ko pehle hataana zaroori hai |\n| 5 | Anjaan namak ki khoj: sab tests saath | Rang dekho, ghulao, cation, anion, formula: dhyan se kram |\n| 6 | Master method, mile-jule puzzles, mass ka numerical, 4 aam galtiyan | Boond-boond daalo, reagent ka naam likho, spectator kaato, (s) likho |\n\n---\n\nNachiket ki team ne Mystery Box game day mein pehla inaam jeeta. Mr. Gunjal ne dher saare cards ko wapas ek rubber band mein bandhte hue kaha, \"Dekha, kram pakad liya to koi bhi bhool-bhulaiya sulajh jaati hai: dekho, cation, anion, likho.\" Nachiket ne cards ka dibba uthaya aur bola, \"Chacha, agle saal main apna Mystery Box khud banaunga!\"\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab agle Chapter 9 (Study of Compounds) mein hum dekhenge ki HCl, ammonia, nitric acid aur sulphuric acid jaise chemicals, jo factories lakhon tonne mein banati hain, kaise banaye jaate hain aur ye itne tez gandh wale, jalane wale aur daag chhodne wale kyun hote hain (sab kuch sirf padhne aur dekhne ke liye, student kabhi nahi banata)."
