            "body": "- **HCl gas** gale, naak aur aankh ko jalati hai aur saans mein ghutan laati hai. Concentrated hydrochloric acid ke \"dhuan\" mein bhi wahi gas hoti hai.\n- **Concentrated H₂SO₄** (jisse lab mein HCl banti hai) bahut jalane wala hai: chamdi, kapde aur kaagaz sab kharab karta hai.\n- Ye saare kaam **school lab mein teacher ke saath, fume cupboard mein, goggles aur gloves ke saath** hote hain. Is topic ki har taiyari aur har demo **sirf padhne ke liye ya sirf dekhne ke liye (teacher demo)** hai. Koi student inhe kabhi nahi banata, nahi sunghta, nahi chhoota.\n- **Toilet cleaner ya koi bhi safai ka ghol kabhi bleach ke saath nahi milana**: isse zehreeli chlorine gas banti hai. Aisi bottle sirf bade kholte hain.\n- Acid ya gas se kuch bhi sampark ho to turant teacher ya bade ko batao. Khud ilaaj mat karo: doctor ya bade ki salah lo.",
