            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne ek **acidic gas**, HCl, ko lab mein banate dekha: mishran garam karo, gas ko dry karo, heavier hone ki wajah se upward displacement se jar mein bharo. Aaj ki gas HCl ki bilkul ulti hai: ek **basic gas**, ammonia NH₃. Jab dono gas paas aati hain to safed dhuan banta hai (Topic 1 ka NH₃ + HCl → NH₄Cl). Aaj dekhenge ki ammonia lab mein kaise banti hai, kaise sookhai aur bharee jaati hai (aur kyun HCl wale tareeke yahan galat hain), kaarkhane mein hawa se kaise banti hai, aur khet tak kaise pahunchti hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein humne ek **acidic gas**, HCl, ko lab mein banate dekha: mishran garam karo, gas ko dry karo, heavier hone ki wajah se upward displacement se jar mein bharo. Aaj ki gas HCl ki bilkul ulti hai: ek **basic gas**, ammonia NH₃. Jab dono gas paas aati hain to safed dhuan banta hai (Topic 1 ka NH₃ + HCl → NH₄Cl). Aaj dekhenge ki ammonia lab mein kaise banti hai, kaise sookhai aur bharee jaati hai (aur kyun HCl wale tareeke yahan galat hain), kaarkhane mein hawa se kaise banti hai, aur khet tak kaise pahunchti hai."
