            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne HCl gas ko NaCl aur concentrated H₂SO₄ se bante dekha, aur Topic 2 mein ammonia ko, jo Haber process se kaarkhaanon mein banti hai. Topic 2 ke uses mein ek line thi: ammonia se **nitric acid** bhi banta hai. Aaj usi acid ki kahani hai: wo lab mein kaise banta hai, kaarkhaane mein ammonia se kaise banta hai (Ostwald process), wo dhatuon ke saath \"ulta\" kyun chalta hai, aur wo kaun sa jodi hai jo gold ko bhi gala deta hai.",
