            "heading": "Sunaar ki dukaan aur \"raja ka ghol\"",
            "headingHinglish": "Sunaar ki dukaan aur \"raja ka ghol\"",
            "body": "Mr. Kanitkar apne bhatije Nihar ko saath lekar sunaar ki dukaan par gaye. Nihar ki dadi ki ek purani anguthi thi: dhundhli, kaali-si pad gayi thi. Sunaar ne use roshni mein ghumaya, kasauti par halka sa ghisa, aur muskura kar bola, \"Gold hi hai, par saath mein thoda taamba bhi mila hai. Saaf karni padegi.\"\n\nDukaan ke peeche ek chhota kamra tha, jiska darwaza band tha aur ek bada pankha bahar hawa phenk raha tha. Nihar ne khidki ke shishe se jhaanka: ek kaanch ke cupboard ke andar halki **bhoori-narangi dhundh** ghoom rahi thi. Sunaar ne dhyan se darwaza aur bhi band kiya. \"Beta, wahan mat aao. Wahan mere tezaab rehte hain. Gold ko **sirf ek khaas ghol gala sakta hai: raja ka ghol**. Wo main bachchon ko kabhi nahi dikhata, aur khud bhi hawadaar cupboard aur dastaane ke bina nahi chhoota.\"\n\nNihar ki aankhen phail gayin. \"Chacha, gold to sabse shaant dhatu hai, na usme jang lagta hai na paani usse kuch karta hai. Aur ye 'raja ka ghol' kya hai? Wo bhoori dhundh kya hai? Aur ye sab tezaab aate kahan se hain?\"\n\nMr. Kanitkar ne ghar lautte hue kaha, \"Teen sawaal hain, aur teeno ka jawaab ek hi acid ke paas hai: **nitric acid**. Chal, ek-ek karke ginte hain.\"\n\n```\n   Nihar ke teen sawaal                      Kahan milega jawaab\n\n   1. Ye acid aata kahan se hai?       -->   Part A (lab) aur Part B (Ostwald)\n   2. Bhoori dhundh kya hai?           -->   Part C (NO₂, oxidising acid)\n   3. Raja ka ghol gold ko kaise gala? -->   Part E (aqua regia)\n```\n\n> **Figure 3.1** – Is topic ka naksha: Nihar ke teen sawaal aur unke jawaab kis Part mein hain. Ye sirf ek yojana hai, koi apparatus nahi.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Kanitkar apne bhatije Nihar ko saath lekar sunaar ki dukaan par gaye. Nihar ki dadi ki ek purani anguthi thi: dhundhli, kaali-si pad gayi thi. Sunaar ne use roshni mein ghumaya, kasauti par halka sa ghisa, aur muskura kar bola, \"Gold hi hai, par saath mein thoda taamba bhi mila hai. Saaf karni padegi.\"\n\nDukaan ke peeche ek chhota kamra tha, jiska darwaza band tha aur ek bada pankha bahar hawa phenk raha tha. Nihar ne khidki ke shishe se jhaanka: ek kaanch ke cupboard ke andar halki **bhoori-narangi dhundh** ghoom rahi thi. Sunaar ne dhyan se darwaza aur bhi band kiya. \"Beta, wahan mat aao. Wahan mere tezaab rehte hain. Gold ko **sirf ek khaas ghol gala sakta hai: raja ka ghol**. Wo main bachchon ko kabhi nahi dikhata, aur khud bhi hawadaar cupboard aur dastaane ke bina nahi chhoota.\"\n\nNihar ki aankhen phail gayin. \"Chacha, gold to sabse shaant dhatu hai, na usme jang lagta hai na paani usse kuch karta hai. Aur ye 'raja ka ghol' kya hai? Wo bhoori dhundh kya hai? Aur ye sab tezaab aate kahan se hain?\"\n\nMr. Kanitkar ne ghar lautte hue kaha, \"Teen sawaal hain, aur teeno ka jawaab ek hi acid ke paas hai: **nitric acid**. Chal, ek-ek karke ginte hain.\"\n\n```\n   Nihar ke teen sawaal                      Kahan milega jawaab\n\n   1. Ye acid aata kahan se hai?       -->   Part A (lab) aur Part B (Ostwald)\n   2. Bhoori dhundh kya hai?           -->   Part C (NO₂, oxidising acid)\n   3. Raja ka ghol gold ko kaise gala? -->   Part E (aqua regia)\n```\n\n> **Figure 3.1** – Is topic ka naksha: Nihar ke teen sawaal aur unke jawaab kis Part mein hain. Ye sirf ek yojana hai, koi apparatus nahi."
