            "heading": "Naye shabd",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Retort** | Gol bulb aur lambi, jhuki hui neck wala poora kaanch ka bartan, jisme garam karke gas ya bhaap ko seedha doosre bartan mein pahunchaya jaata hai | HNO₃ ki lab preparation |\n| **Distil hona** | Garam hone par bhaap ban kar uda hua padarth jo thande bartan mein phir se boond ban jaaye | HNO₃ retort se receiver mein |\n| **Fuming acid** | Aisa acid jisse khuli hawa mein dhuein jaisi bhaap uthti hai | concentrated HNO₃ |\n| **Oxidising agent** | Aisa padarth jo doosre padarth ko oxidise kar de, yaani use ek \"oonche roop\" mein badal de (jaise Cu ko Cu²⁺ mein, C ko CO₂ mein) | concentrated HNO₃ |\n| **Ostwald process** | Ammonia ko hawa ki oxygen se nitric acid mein badalne ka kaarkhaane ka tareeka | NH₃ → NO → NO₂ → HNO₃ |\n| **Gauze (jaali)** | Patle taaron ki jaali jisse gas guzarti hai | Pt-Rh gauze |\n| **Passive dhatu** | Wo dhatu jiski satah par bani parat use aage reaction karne se rok deti hai | Fe, Al aur concentrated HNO₃ |\n| **Aqua regia** | Concentrated HCl ke 3 volume aur concentrated HNO₃ ke 1 volume ka taaza mix; \"raja ka ghol\" | gold aur platinum ko ghulata hai |",
