            "body": "- **Concentrated nitric acid** chamdi ko jalata hai aur use **peela** kar deta hai. Aankh, naak aur gale ko nuksaan.\n- **NO₂ (bhoori gas) aur NO** zehreeli hain: phephdon ko nuksaan, jo kabhi kabhi der se dikhta hai.\n- Is poore topic ke saare reactions **sirf padhne ke liye** ya **sirf dekhne ke liye (teacher demo)** hain: fume cupboard, goggles, gloves, aur teacher. Koi student inhein banata, chhoota, sunghta ya test nahi karta.\n- Concentrated H₂SO₄ bhi yahan aayega: wo bhi jalane wala hai (uska poora topic aage Topic 5 mein).\n- Ghar mein koi aisi botal mile jis par khatre ka chinh ho to **bachche kabhi na chhuen**: bade se poochho aur label sirf bade ke saath padho.",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Concentrated nitric acid** chamdi ko jalata hai aur use **peela** kar deta hai. Aankh, naak aur gale ko nuksaan.\n- **NO₂ (bhoori gas) aur NO** zehreeli hain: phephdon ko nuksaan, jo kabhi kabhi der se dikhta hai.\n- Is poore topic ke saare reactions **sirf padhne ke liye** ya **sirf dekhne ke liye (teacher demo)** hain: fume cupboard, goggles, gloves, aur teacher. Koi student inhein banata, chhoota, sunghta ya test nahi karta.\n- Concentrated H₂SO₄ bhi yahan aayega: wo bhi jalane wala hai (uska poora topic aage Topic 5 mein).\n- Ghar mein koi aisi botal mile jis par khatre ka chinh ho to **bachche kabhi na chhuen**: bade se poochho aur label sirf bade ke saath padho."
