        "summary": "Topic 4 mein hamne dekha ki factory mein sulphur se H₂SO₄ kaise banta hai, aur ki Contact process ka aakhri product gaadha (concentrated) H₂SO₄ hota hai: lagbhag 98 percent acid, baaki thoda sa paani.",
