            "body": "Mr. Zagade apni bhatiji Durva ke school ke annual science quiz mein baithe the. Quiz ka naam tha **\"Compound Pehchaan\"**. Stage par ek anchor clue cards padh raha tha, aur har team ko sirf clue sunkar compound ka naam batana tha.\n\nPehla card: \"Bina rang ki gas, tez chubhne wali gandh, gili laal litmus ko neela kar deti hai.\" Durva ki team ne turant haath uthaya: \"Ammonia!\" Doosra card: \"Bina rang ki gas, nami wali hawa mein dhuan banati hai, AgNO₃ se safed curdy dhodha.\" Ye bhi sahi nikla: HCl. Teesre card par team atak gayi: \"Bina rang ki gas, jali hui match-stick jaisi gandh, heavy hai, paani mein bahut ghulti hai.\" Durva ne kaha, \"Chacha, mujhe lagta hai SO₂, par kaise pakka karun?\"\n\nGhar jaate waqt Mr. Zagade ne kaha, \"Durva, quiz sirf yaad karne ka khel nahi hai. Har clue ke peeche ek **kyun** hota hai. Gas ko kaise banate hain, kaise jama karte hain, kaise sukhate hain, aur kaun si cheez usse react karegi: ye chaar sawaal poochho to koi bhi gas pakda jaata hai.\" Durva ne poochha, \"Aur agar kisi gas ko ek tarah se sukhaya aur wo kharab ho gayi?\" Chacha muskuraye. \"Yahi to aaj ka sabse mazedaar hissa hai.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Zagade apni bhatiji Durva ke school ke annual science quiz mein baithe the. Quiz ka naam tha **\"Compound Pehchaan\"**. Stage par ek anchor clue cards padh raha tha, aur har team ko sirf clue sunkar compound ka naam batana tha.\n\nPehla card: \"Bina rang ki gas, tez chubhne wali gandh, gili laal litmus ko neela kar deti hai.\" Durva ki team ne turant haath uthaya: \"Ammonia!\" Doosra card: \"Bina rang ki gas, nami wali hawa mein dhuan banati hai, AgNO₃ se safed curdy dhodha.\" Ye bhi sahi nikla: HCl. Teesre card par team atak gayi: \"Bina rang ki gas, jali hui match-stick jaisi gandh, heavy hai, paani mein bahut ghulti hai.\" Durva ne kaha, \"Chacha, mujhe lagta hai SO₂, par kaise pakka karun?\"\n\nGhar jaate waqt Mr. Zagade ne kaha, \"Durva, quiz sirf yaad karne ka khel nahi hai. Har clue ke peeche ek **kyun** hota hai. Gas ko kaise banate hain, kaise jama karte hain, kaise sukhate hain, aur kaun si cheez usse react karegi: ye chaar sawaal poochho to koi bhi gas pakda jaata hai.\" Durva ne poochha, \"Aur agar kisi gas ko ek tarah se sukhaya aur wo kharab ho gayi?\" Chacha muskuraye. \"Yahi to aaj ka sabse mazedaar hissa hai.\""
