            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Drying agent** | Aisa padarth jo gas ki nami kheench leta hai (Class 9 ke Water chapter se) | conc. H₂SO₄, quicklime CaO |\n| **Upward displacement of air** | Bhaari gas ko seedhi jar mein neeche se bharna; hawa upar se nikalti hai | HCl, Cl₂, SO₂ |\n| **Downward displacement of air** | Halki gas ko ulti jar mein upar se bharna; hawa neeche se nikalti hai | NH₃ |\n| **Vapour density (VD)** | Gas barabar volume ki hydrogen se kitne guna bhaari hai; VD = M ÷ 2 (Chapter 5) | HCl ka VD 18.25 |\n| **Gas wash bottle** | Do ched wale cork wali bottle jisme gas ek liquid se guzar kar sookhti hai | conc. H₂SO₄ wali bottle |\n| **Suck-back** | Thande hote hi paani ka tube mein wapas khinch aana | gas ko paani mein ghulate waqt |\n| **Catalyst** | Aisa padarth jo reaction ko tez karta hai aur khud nahi ghista | V₂O₅, Fe, Pt |\n| **Clue card** | Gas ki pehchaan ke chhote sanket: rang, gandh, dhuan, litmus | Compound Pehchaan quiz |"
