            "body": "| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | HCl gas aur hydrochloric acid | NaCl aur conc. H₂SO₄ se banti hai, upward displacement; dry HCl gas khud acidic nahi, paani se acid |\n| 2 | Ammonia: lab se khet tak | NH₄Cl aur Ca(OH)₂ se, downward displacement, CaO se sukhti; Haber se khaad |\n| 3 | Nitric acid | KNO₃ aur conc. H₂SO₄ se; Ostwald; oxidiser, H₂ nahi; aqua regia |\n| 4 | Sulphuric acid: Contact process | S se SO₂, SO₃ (V₂O₅), oleum, phir H₂SO₄; SO₃ seedha paani mein nahi |\n| 5 | Concentrated H₂SO₄ | Dehydrator, oxidiser, drying agent; acid ko paani mein, ulta kabhi nahi |\n| 6 | Sab kuch mila kar | Gas jama karna aur sukhana; clue se pehchaan; catalyst sirf raftaar |\n\nChaaron kirdaar ab tumhari pehchaan mein hain: ek acid, ek base-wali gas, ek oxidiser, aur ek dehydrator. Shabaash!\n\nAage kya? Chapter 10 Carbon and Its Compounds mein: cheeni, sabun, plastic aur petrol ke peeche ek hi tatva hai, carbon: wo itne lakhon compounds kyun banata hai?",
