            "body": "Teesri tarah ke isomer mein **functional group hi alag** hota hai. Sabse chhota example C₂H₆O ka hai.\n\n```\n      H   H                 H       H\n      I   I                 I       I\n  H - C - C - O - H     H - C - O - C - H\n      I   I                 I       I\n      H   H                 H       H\n\n    ethanol               methoxymethane\n```\n\n> **Figure 3.9** – C₂H₆O ke do compound. Baayen: ethanol (CH₃CH₂OH, –OH group, alcohol). Daayen: methoxymethane (CH₃OCH₃), jisme oxygen do carbon ke beech hai (ether). Har C par 4 bond, har O par 2, har H par 1. Dono mein 2 C, 6 H, 1 O.\n\nDono ka formula ek, par functional group alag, isliye gun bhi alag-alag; ethanol ka poora paath Topic 6 mein. **Teen tarah ke isomer ek nazar mein:**\n\n| Kism | Kya badla | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| Chain isomer | chain ki banawat (seedhi ya shakha wali) | butane aur 2-methylpropane |\n| Position isomer | double bond ya group ki jagah | but-1-ene aur but-2-ene; propan-1-ol aur propan-2-ol |\n| Functional isomer | functional group hi | ethanol aur methoxymethane |",
