            "correctIndex": 3,
            "explanation": "Pitfall to avoid (\"Methanol aur ethanol ek jaise hain, dono safe.\"): Dono ke formula bhi lagbhag ek jaise hain, dono bina rang ke, dono jalte hain. Par dono ka asar sharir par bilkul alag hai: | Sawaal | Ethanol | Methanol | |---|---|---| | Formula | C₂H₅OH | CH₃OH | | Molar mass | 46 | 32 | | Farq | methanol se ek CH₂ zyada (46 − 32 = 14) | ek CH₂ kam | | Boiling point | lagbhag 78 °C | lagbhag 65 °C | | Sharir ke andar | dimaag aur jigar par asar, par sanitiser jaisi bahut kam matra haath par alag baat hai | zehreela: aankh ki nas aur jaan ka khatra | Ek kahani: ek dukaan mein do bina label ki bottles pad gayi thi, ek ethanol ki, ek methanol ki. Dono bina rang ki, dono ek jaisi gandh. Ek naya karmchari bola, \"ek ka formula ek CH₂ zyada hai, wahi to farq hai, safe hoga.\" Sabak: sirf ek CH₂ ka farq sharir ke liye zindagi aur maut ka farq ho sakta hai. Pehchaan label aur supplier se hoti hai, gandh ya rang se nahi, aur bina label ki bottle kabhi nahi chhoo. Niyam: dono alag padarth hain. Methanol zehreela hai. Ethanol ko bhi kabhi peene ki cheez ya sanitiser ko paani samajhna galat hai.",
            "explanationHinglish": "Bachke rehna (\"Methanol aur ethanol ek jaise hain, dono safe.\"): Dono ke formula bhi lagbhag ek jaise hain, dono bina rang ke, dono jalte hain. Par dono ka asar sharir par bilkul alag hai: | Sawaal | Ethanol | Methanol | |---|---|---| | Formula | C₂H₅OH | CH₃OH | | Molar mass | 46 | 32 | | Farq | methanol se ek CH₂ zyada (46 − 32 = 14) | ek CH₂ kam | | Boiling point | lagbhag 78 °C | lagbhag 65 °C | | Sharir ke andar | dimaag aur jigar par asar, par sanitiser jaisi bahut kam matra haath par alag baat hai | zehreela: aankh ki nas aur jaan ka khatra | Ek kahani: ek dukaan mein do bina label ki bottles pad gayi thi, ek ethanol ki, ek methanol ki. Dono bina rang ki, dono ek jaisi gandh. Ek naya karmchari bola, \"ek ka formula ek CH₂ zyada hai, wahi to farq hai, safe hoga.\" Sabak: sirf ek CH₂ ka farq sharir ke liye zindagi aur maut ka farq ho sakta hai. Pehchaan label aur supplier se hoti hai, gandh ya rang se nahi, aur bina label ki bottle kabhi nahi chhoo. Niyam: dono alag padarth hain. Methanol zehreela hai. Ethanol ko bhi kabhi peene ki cheez ya sanitiser ko paani samajhna galat hai."
