            "body": "Topic 6 mein hamne dekha ki ethanol ko oxidise karo to ethanoic acid banta hai: C₂H₅OH + 2[O] → CH₃COOH + H₂O. Ab hum us **ethanoic acid** ko seedhe milenge. Ye wahi weak acid hai jise tumne Chapter 1 aur Chapter 4 mein ek **formula** ki tarah dekha tha: CH₃COOH ⇌ CH₃COO⁻ + H⁺. Ab hum us formula ke andar jhaankenge: kaun sa H acidic hai, kaun sa nahi; ye acid kaise carbonate se jhaag banata hai, base se namak, aur **alcohol se ek khushbudaar nayi cheez**. Aaj ke topic ke do sawaal: ye khattapan kahan se aata hai, aur ye khushboo kahan se?",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 6 mein hamne dekha ki ethanol ko oxidise karo to ethanoic acid banta hai: C₂H₅OH + 2[O] → CH₃COOH + H₂O. Ab hum us **ethanoic acid** ko seedhe milenge. Ye wahi weak acid hai jise tumne Chapter 1 aur Chapter 4 mein ek **formula** ki tarah dekha tha: CH₃COOH ⇌ CH₃COO⁻ + H⁺. Ab hum us formula ke andar jhaankenge: kaun sa H acidic hai, kaun sa nahi; ye acid kaise carbonate se jhaag banata hai, base se namak, aur **alcohol se ek khushbudaar nayi cheez**. Aaj ke topic ke do sawaal: ye khattapan kahan se aata hai, aur ye khushboo kahan se?"
