            "heading": "Part E: Ethanoic acid aur uske saathiyon ke upyog",
            "headingHinglish": "Part E: Ethanoic acid aur uske saathiyon ke upyog",
            "body": "| Upyog | Kaise |\n|---|---|\n| Sirka | khaane mein khattapan, salad aur chaat mein |\n| Achaar (pickle) | thode paani wale, acidic maahaul mein khaana kharab karne wale jeev nahi panpte |\n| Rang (dyes) aur chhapai | kuch rang banane aur pakke karne mein |\n| Dawaiyan | kuch dawaiyon ke banane mein |\n| Solvent | kuch plastic, rang aur paint ke liye |\n| Artificial flavour aur perfume | ester ki phal-jaisi khushbu |\n| Safai | kettle ya nal ki chaak jaisi parat (limescale) ko ghulane mein: Class 9 ka chaak aur sirka |\n\nAaji ka sirka achaar ko is liye bachata hai ki **acidic maahaul** mein khaana kharab karne wale jeev (bacteria aur fungus) nahi panpte. (Ye Aaji ki baat ka seedha jawab hai.) Ghar mein achaar bade banate hain: bachche nahi.",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Upyog | Kaise |\n|---|---|\n| Sirka | khaane mein khattapan, salad aur chaat mein |\n| Achaar (pickle) | thode paani wale, acidic maahaul mein khaana kharab karne wale jeev nahi panpte |\n| Rang (dyes) aur chhapai | kuch rang banane aur pakke karne mein |\n| Dawaiyan | kuch dawaiyon ke banane mein |\n| Solvent | kuch plastic, rang aur paint ke liye |\n| Artificial flavour aur perfume | ester ki phal-jaisi khushbu |\n| Safai | kettle ya nal ki chaak jaisi parat (limescale) ko ghulane mein: Class 9 ka chaak aur sirka |\n\nAaji ka sirka achaar ko is liye bachata hai ki **acidic maahaul** mein khaana kharab karne wale jeev (bacteria aur fungus) nahi panpte. (Ye Aaji ki baat ka seedha jawab hai.) Ghar mein achaar bade banate hain: bachche nahi."
