            "body": "| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. Carbon Ki Khaasiyat | tetravalency, catenation, allotrope | Chaar haath, chhota size aur mazboot C–C bond se carbon ke lakhon compound bante hain; heera aur graphite ek hi tatva hain. |\n| 2. Homologous Series Aur Functional Group | series, general formula, functional group | Ek hi parivaar ke members CH₂ (14) se alag, chemical gun ek jaise, physical gun dheere-dheere badalte hain. |\n| 3. Naam Aur Isomer | naam dene ke kadam; chain, position aur functional isomer | Sabse lambi chain naam deti hai, number sabse chhota; ek hi formula, alag structure matlab isomer. |\n| 4. Alkanes | saturated, jalna, substitution | Alkane kam reactive par jalte hain; poora jalna CO₂ aur paani deta hai, adhoora CO aur kaalikh. |\n| 5. Alkenes Aur Alkynes | double aur triple bond, addition | Extra jodi khulti hai: addition, bromine water ka test, polythene; kabhi plastic nahi jalana. |\n| 6. Ethanol | –OH, fermentation, reactions | Ethanol sanitiser, fuel aur solvent hai; methanol zehreela hai, aur sharab bachon ke liye bilkul nahi. |\n| 7. Ethanoic Acid | –COOH, weak acid, ester | Sirka weak acid hai (carbonate se fizz); acid aur alcohol se phal jaisi khushbu wala ester. |\n| 8. Sabun Aur Detergent | micelle, saponification, kathor paani | Do-mooh wala molecule grease ko micelle mein pakadta hai; kathor paani mein sabun scum banata hai, detergent nahi. |\n| 9. Sab Kuch Mila Kar | reaction map, mixed sawaal | Ek naksha jisme har teer ka type, reagent aur condition hai; formula, bond aur test saath-saath chalte hain. |\n\n---\n\nMr. Mahajan ne Vikrant ke haath mein khel ka chhota sa trophy tamaya: \"Ye sirf card sahi rakhne ka nahi, raasta samajhne ka inaam hai.\" Vikrant ne naksha sambhal kar bag mein rakha. **Badhai ho!** Tumne Class 10 Chemistry ka aakhri chapter, aur poori Class 10 Chemistry, khatam kar li: acid, base aur namak se leke carbon ke lakhon compound tak ka safar.\n\n**Aage kya?** Ab Class 10 Physics mein milte hain: pehla chapter gravitation aur space missions ka hai, jahan satellite, rocket aur bhaarheenta (weightlessness) ke raaz tumhara intezaar kar rahe hain.",
